window.DPDATA = {"version":1,"modules":[{"id":"m0","title":"Asoslar","desc":"Greedy nima, qarshi misol va isbot usullari"},{"id":"m1","title":"Saralash","desc":"Intervallar, comparator, nisbatlar"},{"id":"m2","title":"Rejalashtirish","desc":"Deadline, EDD, Moore–Hodgson"},{"id":"m3","title":"Heap greedy","desc":"PriorityQueue va regret greedy"},{"id":"m4","title":"Ko'rsatkichlar","desc":"Two pointers, multiset, sakrash"},{"id":"m5","title":"Satrlar","desc":"Leksikografik greedy, monoton stek"},{"id":"m6","title":"Graflar","desc":"MST va Dijkstra"},{"id":"m7","title":"Konstruktiv","desc":"Invariantlar va javobni qurish"},{"id":"m8","title":"Binary search","desc":"Javob bo'yicha qidiruv + greedy check"},{"id":"m9","title":"Strategiya","desc":"Matroid, chegaralar, cheklist"}],"lessons":[{"id":"l01","module":"m0","week":1,"title":"Greedy nima va qachon ishlaydi","mins":40,"viz":["coins"],"problems":["p01","p02"],"goals":["Greedy tanlov va optimal substructure'ni tushunish","Greedy ishlamaydigan holatni qarshi misol bilan ko'rsatish","Greedy'ni DP'dan farqlash"],"summary":"Har qadamda hozirgi eng yaxshi tanlov, unga qaytmaslik — va bu qachon xato bo'lishi.","md":"## Ta'rif\n\n**Greedy (ochko'z) algoritm** — har qadamda **hozir eng yaxshi ko'rinadigan** tanlovni qiladi va unga hech qachon qaytmaydi. Kelajakni o'ylamaydi, variantlarni sanamaydi, faqat bitta yo'l bilan ketadi.\n\nShuning uchun greedy odatda juda tez (ko'pincha `O(n log n)` — saralash narxi) va qisqa yoziladi. Muammo bitta: **har doim ham to'g'ri emas**.\n\nGreedy to'g'ri ishlashi uchun masalada ikki xususiyat bo'lishi kerak:\n\n- **Greedy choice property** — mahalliy (lokal) eng yaxshi tanlovni o'z ichiga olgan optimal yechim mavjud.\n- **Optimal substructure** — tanlov qilingandan keyin qolgan masala ham xuddi shunday optimal yechiladi.\n\n> [!NOTE] DP ham optimal substructure'dan foydalanadi, lekin har qadamda **barcha** tanlovlarni ko'rib chiqadi. Greedy esa bittasini tanlaydi va qolganini tashlaydi.\n\n## Ishlaydigan misol: so'm bilan qaytim\n\nQaytim berishda eng katta mos kupyuradan boshlaymiz: 1000, 2000, 5000, 10 000, 20 000, 50 000, 100 000, 200 000. 37 000 so'm → 20 000 + 10 000 + 5 000 + 2 000 — 4 ta kupyura, bu minimal.\n\nBunday tizimlar **canonical** deyiladi: ularda greedy doim optimal. Real valyutalar ataylab shunday tuzilgan.\n\n```java\nstatic int greedyCoins(int[] coins, int x) {\n    Arrays.sort(coins);\n    int cnt = 0;\n    for (int i = coins.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {\n        cnt += x / coins[i];\n        x %= coins[i];\n    }\n    return x == 0 ? cnt : -1;\n}\n```\n\n## Ishlamaydigan misol\n\nTangalar `{1, 3, 4}`, summa 6:\n\n- Greedy: 4 + 1 + 1 → **3 ta** tanga\n- Optimal: 3 + 3 → **2 ta** tanga\n\nGreedy 4 ni oldi — \"hozir eng yaxshi\" — va bu tanlov keyingi qadamlarni yomonlashtirdi. Bunday masala uchun DP kerak (coin change).\n\n> [!WARN] Greedy yechim 5 daqiqada yoziladi va namunaviy testlardan o'tadi, lekin yashirin testda yiqiladi. Doim **qarshi misol** izlang.\n\n## Greedy qanday topiladi\n\n1. **Qoidani taklif qiling.** \"Eng kichigini olaman\", \"eng erta tugaydiganini olaman\", \"eng katta nisbatlisini olaman\"…\n2. **Buzib ko'ring.** 3–5 elementli kichik misollar o'ylang, ayniqsa chegaraviy: teng qiymatlar, bitta element, juda katta bitta element.\n3. **Isbotlang yoki sinang.** Keyingi darsdagi exchange argument bilan, yoki brute force bilan stress test.\n\nBir masalaga odatda bir nechta \"tabiiy\" greedy qoidasi bor, va ulardan faqat bittasi to'g'ri bo'ladi. Masalan, intervallarni tanlashda \"eng qisqasini olish\" ham, \"eng erta boshlanadiganini olish\" ham xato — faqat \"eng erta tugaydiganini olish\" to'g'ri (3-dars).\n\n## Greedy shakllari\n\n| Shakl | Qachon | Misol |\n|---|---|---|\n| Saralash + bir o'tish | Tartib hamma narsani hal qilsa | Intervallar, Tasks and Deadlines |\n| PriorityQueue | Har qadamda \"hozirgi eng yaxshi\" o'zgarib tursa | Huffman, IPO |\n| Ikki ko'rsatkich | Saralangan ikki uchni juftlash | Ferris Wheel |\n| Monoton stek | Leksikografik eng kichik natija | Remove K Digits |\n| Binary search + greedy check | \"Minimal maksimum\" turidagi javob | Array Division |\n\n## Birinchi masala: Lemonade Change\n\nLimonad 5 so'm. Xaridorlar 5, 10 yoki 20 lik pul beradi. Har biriga qaytim bera olamizmi? 20 lik uchun qaytim 15: `10 + 5` yoki `5 + 5 + 5`. Greedy: **10 + 5 ni afzal ko'ring**, chunki 5 lik universal (10 ga ham, 20 ga ham kerak), 10 lik esa faqat 20 uchun foydali.\n\n```java\nint five = 0, ten = 0;\nfor (int b : bills) {\n    if (b == 5) five++;\n    else if (b == 10) {\n        if (five == 0) return false;\n        five--;\n        ten++;\n    } else {\n        if (ten > 0 && five > 0) { ten--; five--; }\n        else if (five >= 3) five -= 3;\n        else return false;\n    }\n}\nreturn true;\n```"},{"id":"l02","module":"m0","week":1,"title":"Greedy'ni isbotlash","mins":50,"viz":[],"problems":["p03"],"goals":["Exchange argument bilan isbot yozish","\"Greedy stays ahead\" usulini qo'llash","Isbot o'rniga stress test qilishni bilish"],"summary":"Exchange argument, \"greedy oldinda boradi\" va brute force bilan amaliy tekshirish.","md":"## Nega isbot kerak?\n\nMusobaqada to'liq rasmiy isbot yozish shart emas. Lekin **isbot g'oyasini** bilish ikki narsani beradi: to'g'ri qoidani tezroq topasiz va noto'g'ri qoidani yuborishdan oldin sezasiz. Uchta asosiy usul bor.\n\n## 1. Exchange argument (almashtirish)\n\nG'oya: istalgan optimal yechim `O` ni olamiz. Agar u greedy yechim `G` dan farq qilsa, `O` da kichik bir almashtirish qilib, natijani **yomonlashtirmasdan** `G` ga yaqinlashtiramiz. Bir necha almashtirishdan keyin `O` = `G`, demak `G` ham optimal.\n\n**Misol: kutish vaqtini minimallashtirish.** n ta ish, i-ishning davomiyligi `t[i]`. Bitta mashina ishlarni ketma-ket bajaradi. Tugash vaqtlari yig'indisini minimallashtiring.\n\nGreedy: **qisqasini birinchi** (Shortest Processing Time).\n\nIsbot: tartibda qo'shni ikki ish `a`, `b` bo'lib, `t[a] > t[b]` bo'lsin. Ularni almashtiramiz. Boshqa ishlarning tugash vaqti o'zgarmaydi. `a` va `b` ning tugash vaqtlari yig'indisi:\n\n- almashtirishdan oldin: `(T + t[a]) + (T + t[a] + t[b])`\n- keyin: `(T + t[b]) + (T + t[b] + t[a])`\n\nFarq `t[a] - t[b] > 0` — almashtirish yig'indini kamaytirdi. Demak optimal tartibda \"inversiya\" (kattasi kichigidan oldin) yo'q, ya'ni u saralangan.\n\n> [!TIP] Saralash kalitini topishning universal usuli: **qo'shni ikki elementni** solishtiring. Qaysi tartib yaxshiroq ekanini ko'rsatadigan shart — sizning comparator'ingiz.\n\n## 2. Greedy stays ahead (greedy oldinda boradi)\n\nG'oya: greedy har qadamda optimaldan **orqada qolmasligini** induksiya bilan ko'rsatish.\n\n**Misol: activity selection.** Greedy eng erta tugaydigan intervalni oladi. Greedy tanlagan intervallar `g1, g2, …` va istalgan optimal yechim `o1, o2, …` (ikkalasi tugash vaqti bo'yicha tartiblangan).\n\nDa'vo: har k uchun `end(g_k) ≤ end(o_k)`.\n\n- k = 1: greedy eng erta tugaydiganini oldi, shuning uchun to'g'ri.\n- k → k+1: `o_{k+1}` boshlanishi `end(o_k) ≥ end(g_k)` dan keyin. Demak `o_{k+1}` greedy uchun ham ruxsat etilgan nomzod edi, greedy esa nomzodlar ichida eng erta tugaydiganini oladi: `end(g_{k+1}) ≤ end(o_{k+1})`.\n\nShunday qilib greedy hech qachon orqada qolmaydi va kamida optimalcha interval oladi.\n\n## 3. Qarama-qarshilik va kesim xossasi\n\n\"Greedy tanlamagan elementni o'z ichiga olgan optimal yechim bor deylik…\" deb boshlab, uni greedy elementi bilan almashtirib, ziddiyatga kelish. MST'dagi **cut property** shunday isbotlanadi (11-dars).\n\n## Median: Stick Lengths\n\nBarcha tayoqlarni bir xil `x` uzunlikka keltirish narxi `Σ |p[i] - x|`. Qaysi x eng yaxshi?\n\nAgar x dan chapda `L` ta, o'ngda `R` ta element bo'lsa, x ni 1 ga o'ngga surish narxni `L - R` ga o'zgartiradi. `L < R` ekan — o'ngga surish foydali; `L > R` bo'lsa — chapga. Muvozanat nuqtasi — **median**.\n\n```java\nArrays.sort(p);\nlong med = p[n / 2], cost = 0;\nfor (long x : p) cost += Math.abs(x - med);\n```\n\n## Amaliy isbot: stress test\n\nMusobaqada isbotga vaqt yo'q bo'lsa — kichik testlarda brute force bilan solishtiring. Greedy uchun bu ayniqsa samarali: qarshi misol odatda 4–6 elementda chiqadi.\n\n```java\nimport java.util.*;\n\npublic class Stress {\n    static int greedy(int[] coins, int x) {\n        int[] c = coins.clone();\n        Arrays.sort(c);\n        int cnt = 0;\n        for (int i = c.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) { cnt += x / c[i]; x %= c[i]; }\n        return x == 0 ? cnt : -1;\n    }\n\n    static int brute(int[] coins, int x) {\n        int[] dp = new int[x + 1];\n        Arrays.fill(dp, Integer.MAX_VALUE / 2);\n        dp[0] = 0;\n        for (int s = 1; s <= x; s++)\n            for (int c : coins) if (c <= s) dp[s] = Math.min(dp[s], dp[s - c] + 1);\n        return dp[x] >= Integer.MAX_VALUE / 2 ? -1 : dp[x];\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Random rnd = new Random(1);\n        for (int it = 0; it < 100000; it++) {\n            int[] coins = {1, rnd.nextInt(9) + 2, rnd.nextInt(9) + 2};\n            int x = rnd.nextInt(30) + 1;\n            if (greedy(coins, x) != brute(coins, x)) {\n                System.out.println(Arrays.toString(coins) + \" x=\" + x + \" greedy=\" + greedy(coins, x) + \" opt=\" + brute(coins, x));\n                return;\n            }\n        }\n        System.out.println(\"Qarshi misol topilmadi\");\n    }\n}\n```\n\n> [!NOTE] Stress test \"isbot\" emas — u faqat sinab ko'rilgan o'lchamlarda xato yo'qligini ko'rsatadi. Lekin amalda xatolarning katta qismini ushlaydi."},{"id":"l03","module":"m1","week":2,"title":"Intervallar","mins":60,"viz":["intervals","rooms"],"problems":["p04","p05","p06"],"goals":["Activity selection'da nega aynan tugash vaqti bo'yicha saralash kerakligini tushunish","Sweep line (hodisalar) usuli","Minimal xonalar va interval qamrovi"],"summary":"Activity selection, sweep line, minimal xonalar, o'qlar va qamrov — intervallar oilasi.","md":"## Activity selection\n\nBitta zal, n ta tadbir `[s, e)`. Kesishmaydigan eng ko'p tadbirni tanlang.\n\nUchta \"tabiiy\" qoida:\n\n| Qoida | Natija | Qarshi misol |\n|---|---|---|\n| Eng erta boshlanadigani | Xato | `[0, 10)`, `[1, 2)`, `[3, 4)` → greedy 1 ta, optimal 2 ta |\n| Eng qisqasi | Xato | `[0, 5)`, `[4, 6)`, `[5, 10)` → greedy 1 ta, optimal 2 ta |\n| **Eng erta tugaydigani** | **To'g'ri** | — |\n\nIntuitsiya: erta tugaydigan interval keyingilar uchun **eng ko'p vaqt qoldiradi**. Isbot — 2-darsdagi \"greedy stays ahead\".\n\n```java\nint[][] a = new int[n][2];\nArrays.sort(a, (x, y) -> Integer.compare(x[1], y[1]));\nint cnt = 0, lastEnd = Integer.MIN_VALUE;\nfor (int[] it : a) {\n    if (it[0] >= lastEnd) {\n        cnt++;\n        lastEnd = it[1];\n    }\n}\n```\n\n> [!WARN] Comparator'da `x[1] - y[1]` yozmang: qiymatlar ±2·10^9 atrofida bo'lsa ayirma `int`dan chiqib, saralash buziladi. Doim `Integer.compare` yoki `Long.compare`.\n\n## Sweep line: bir vaqtda nechta?\n\n\"Bir vaqtning o'zida eng ko'p nechta interval ochiq?\" — intervallarni **hodisalarga** aylantiramiz: boshlanish `+1`, tugash `-1`. Hodisalarni vaqt bo'yicha saralab, hisoblagichni yuritamiz.\n\n```java\nlong[] ev = new long[2 * n];\nfor (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n    ev[2 * i] = (long) s[i] * 2 + 1;\n    ev[2 * i + 1] = (long) e[i] * 2;\n}\nArrays.sort(ev);\nint cur = 0, best = 0;\nfor (long x : ev) {\n    cur += (x & 1) == 1 ? 1 : -1;\n    best = Math.max(best, cur);\n}\n```\n\nBu yerda hodisa bitta `long`ga kodlangan: `vaqt * 2 + tur`. Bir xil vaqtda tugash (`+0`) boshlanishdan (`+1`) oldin keladi — yarim ochiq `[s, e)` intervallar uchun to'g'ri. Yopiq intervallar uchun tartibni teskari qiling.\n\n## Minimal xonalar (interval partitioning)\n\nBarcha tadbirlarni o'tkazish uchun minimal nechta zal kerak? Javob — bir vaqtda ochiq intervallarning maksimal soni (yuqoridagi sweep). Har tadbirga **qaysi zal** berilishini ham topish uchun: boshlanish bo'yicha saralab, bo'shagan zallarni min-heap'da saqlaymiz.\n\n```java\nArrays.sort(a, (x, y) -> Integer.compare(x[0], y[0]));\nPriorityQueue<Integer> ends = new PriorityQueue<>();\nfor (int[] it : a) {\n    if (!ends.isEmpty() && ends.peek() <= it[0]) ends.poll();\n    ends.add(it[1]);\n}\nSystem.out.println(ends.size());\n```\n\nHeap'da har zalning hozirgi tugash vaqti. Eng erta bo'shaydigani bo'sh bo'lsa — o'sha zalni qayta ishlatamiz, aks holda yangi zal.\n\n## Minimal o'qlar\n\nGorizontal sharlar `[x1, x2]`. Vertikal o'q `x` nuqtadagi barcha sharlarni yoradi. Minimal o'qlar soni? Tugash bo'yicha saralab, o'qni **joriy sharning oxiriga** otamiz — u shu nuqtagacha boshlangan hammasini yoradi.\n\n```java\nArrays.sort(a, (x, y) -> Long.compare(x[1], y[1]));\nint arrows = 0;\nlong pos = Long.MIN_VALUE;\nfor (long[] b : a) {\n    if (b[0] > pos) {\n        arrows++;\n        pos = b[1];\n    }\n}\n```\n\nBu activity selection'ning o'zi: o'qlar soni = o'zaro kesishmaydigan sharlarning maksimal soni.\n\n## Qamrov (interval covering)\n\n`[0, T]` kesmani minimal sondagi interval bilan to'liq yoping. Greedy: hozir yopilgan joy `cur`. `cur` dan oldin boshlanadigan intervallar ichidan **eng uzoqqa boradiganini** tanlaymiz.\n\n```java\nArrays.sort(a, (x, y) -> Integer.compare(x[0], y[0]));\nint cur = 0, i = 0, cnt = 0;\nwhile (cur < T) {\n    int far = cur;\n    while (i < n && a[i][0] <= cur) far = Math.max(far, a[i++][1]);\n    if (far == cur) { cnt = -1; break; }\n    cur = far;\n    cnt++;\n}\n```\n\n## Xulosa jadvali\n\n| Masala | Saralash kaliti | Qo'shimcha |\n|---|---|---|\n| Maksimal kesishmaydigan | tugash | — |\n| Minimal o'chirish (kesishmasin) | tugash | `n - maksimal` |\n| Bir vaqtda maksimal | hodisalar | +1 / -1 |\n| Minimal xonalar | boshlanish | min-heap |\n| Minimal o'qlar | tugash | — |\n| Kesmani yopish | boshlanish | eng uzoq yetadigani |"},{"id":"l04","module":"m1","week":3,"title":"Saralash va comparator","mins":55,"viz":["frac"],"problems":["p07","p08","p09"],"goals":["Qo'shni juftlik usuli bilan saralash kalitini chiqarish","Java'da xavfsiz comparator yozish","Nisbat bo'yicha saralashni kasrsiz bajarish"],"summary":"Greedy'ning yuragi — to'g'ri tartib. Comparator tuzoqlari, nisbatlar, birlashtirilgan satrlar.","md":"## Kalitni qanday topish\n\nKo'p greedy masalalar \"elementlarni qandaydir tartibda olish\" ga keladi. Kalitni topish usuli (2-darsdan): **ikki qo'shni element a va b ni almashtirsak nima o'zgaradi?** Faqat shu ikkitasining hissasi o'zgaradi — shundan comparator kelib chiqadi.\n\n**Tasks and Deadlines** (CSES). Har ish: davomiylik `a`, deadline `d`. Mukofot `d - f` (f — tugash vaqti, manfiy ham bo'ladi). Umumiy mukofot `Σd - Σf`. `Σd` tartibga bog'liq emas, demak `Σf` ni minimallashtirish kerak → **qisqasini birinchi**.\n\n```java\nArrays.sort(task, (x, y) -> Integer.compare(x[0], y[0]));\nlong time = 0, reward = 0;\nfor (int[] t : task) {\n    time += t[0];\n    reward += t[1] - time;\n}\n```\n\nDeadline umuman tartibga ta'sir qilmaydi — bu masalaning \"hiylasi\".\n\n## Java comparator qoidalari\n\n```java\nArrays.sort(a, (x, y) -> Integer.compare(x[1], y[1]));\nArrays.sort(a, Comparator.comparingInt((int[] x) -> x[1]).thenComparingInt(x -> x[0]));\nlist.sort((x, y) -> Long.compare(y.value, x.value));\n```\n\n- **Ayirma ishlatmang:** `x[1] - y[1]` overflow beradi.\n- **Comparator tranzitiv bo'lishi shart.** Aks holda Java `IllegalArgumentException: Comparison method violates its general contract!` tashlaydi — bu ko'pincha haqiqiy mantiqiy xato belgisi.\n- **`Arrays.sort(int[])` va hack.** Primitiv massivlarda dual-pivot quicksort ishlatiladi, Codeforces'da maxsus test bilan O(n²) ga tushirish mumkin. Yechim: saralashdan oldin aralashtiring yoki `Integer[]`/`long[]` ni `ArrayList` orqali saralang (u merge sort).\n\n```java\nstatic void safeSort(int[] a) {\n    Random r = new Random();\n    for (int i = a.length - 1; i > 0; i--) {\n        int j = r.nextInt(i + 1);\n        int t = a[i]; a[i] = a[j]; a[j] = t;\n    }\n    Arrays.sort(a);\n}\n```\n\n## Satrlarni birlashtirish: Largest Number\n\nSonlardan eng katta birlashma tuzing: `[3, 30, 34, 5, 9]` → `9534330`. Oddiy satr saralash xato (`30` > `3` deb qaraladi). Qo'shni juftlik usuli: `a` ni `b` dan oldin qo'yish yaxshi, agar `a + b > b + a` (satr sifatida).\n\n```java\nString[] s = new String[n];\nfor (int i = 0; i < n; i++) s[i] = String.valueOf(a[i]);\nArrays.sort(s, (x, y) -> (y + x).compareTo(x + y));\nif (s[0].equals(\"0\")) System.out.println(\"0\");\nelse System.out.println(String.join(\"\", s));\n```\n\n> [!NOTE] Bu comparator tranzitiv ekanini isbotlash mumkin (`a + b` ni sonlar orqali yozib), shuning uchun saralash to'g'ri ishlaydi.\n\n## Nisbat bo'yicha: fractional knapsack\n\nBuyumlarni **bo'lib olish mumkin** bo'lsa (un, guruch), greedy optimal: qiymat/og'irlik nisbati eng kattasidan boshlab olamiz, oxirgisini qisman.\n\nKasrlarsiz solishtirish: `v1/w1 > v2/w2` ⇔ `v1·w2 > v2·w1` (`long`da).\n\n```java\nArrays.sort(it, (x, y) -> Long.compare((long) y[1] * x[0], (long) x[1] * y[0]));\ndouble total = 0;\nlong cap = W;\nfor (int[] b : it) {\n    if (cap == 0) break;\n    long take = Math.min(cap, b[0]);\n    total += (double) b[1] * take / b[0];\n    cap -= take;\n}\n```\n\n> [!WARN] 0/1 knapsack'da (bo'lib bo'lmaydi) bu greedy **ishlamaydi**: W = 50, buyumlar (10, 60), (20, 100), (30, 120). Nisbat bo'yicha 10 + 20 = 160, optimal 20 + 30 = 220.\n\n## Smith qoidasi\n\nHar ishning davomiyligi `t` va og'irligi `w`. `Σ w·f` ni minimallashtirish. Qo'shni juftlik: `a` oldin yaxshi, agar `t[a]·w[b] < t[b]·w[a]`, ya'ni `t/w` nisbati kichigi oldin. SPT — bu `w = 1` dagi xususiy holat."},{"id":"l05","module":"m2","week":4,"title":"Deadline'li rejalashtirish","mins":60,"viz":[],"problems":["p10","p11"],"goals":["EDD qoidasini va uning isbotini bilish","Moore–Hodgson: eng ko'p ishni o'z vaqtida bajarish","Deadline + foyda masalasini heap bilan yechish"],"summary":"Kechikishni minimallashtirish, eng ko'p ishni ulgurish va foydali ishlarni tanlash.","md":"## Maksimal kechikishni minimallashtirish\n\nHar ish: davomiylik `t`, deadline `d`. Kechikish `max(0, f - d)`. **Eng katta** kechikishni minimallashtiring.\n\nGreedy: **Earliest Deadline First (EDD)** — deadline bo'yicha saralang. Davomiylik ahamiyatsiz!\n\nIsbot (exchange): qo'shni `a`, `b` da `d[a] > d[b]` bo'lsa, ularni almashtiramiz. `b` erta tugaydi — uning kechikishi kamayadi. `a` endi juftlikning ikkinchisi bo'lib, avval `b` tugagan vaqtda tugaydi, lekin `d[a] > d[b]` bo'lgani uchun uning kechikishi avval `b` niki bo'lgan qiymatdan katta emas. Maksimum oshmadi.\n\n## Eng ko'p ishni o'z vaqtida bajarish\n\nEndi maqsad boshqa: deadline'gacha tugaydigan ishlar **soni** maksimal bo'lsin (kechikkanlar umuman bajarilmaydi). Bu LeetCode **Course Schedule III**.\n\n**Moore–Hodgson algoritmi:**\n1. Deadline bo'yicha saralang.\n2. Ishlarni birma-bir \"qabul qiling\", umumiy vaqtni yuriting.\n3. Agar umumiy vaqt joriy deadline'dan oshsa — qabul qilinganlar ichidan **eng uzunini** chiqarib tashlang.\n\n```java\nArrays.sort(c, (x, y) -> Integer.compare(x[1], y[1]));\nPriorityQueue<Integer> taken = new PriorityQueue<>(Collections.reverseOrder());\nlong time = 0;\nfor (int[] it : c) {\n    taken.add(it[0]);\n    time += it[0];\n    if (time > it[1]) time -= taken.poll();\n}\nSystem.out.println(taken.size());\n```\n\nNega eng uzunini? Hozirgacha qabul qilinganlar soni bir xil qoladi (bitta qo'shdik, bitta chiqardik), lekin umumiy vaqt **imkon qadar ko'p** qisqaradi — keyingi ishlar uchun eng ko'p joy qoladi. Bu \"regret\" (afsus) greedy'ning birinchi namunasi — 7-darsda batafsil.\n\n## Deadline + foyda (bir birlik vaqtli ishlar)\n\nHar ish 1 birlik vaqt oladi, deadline `d` va foyda `p` bor. Maksimal foyda?\n\n**1-usul (klassik):** foyda bo'yicha kamayish tartibida saralab, har ishni **deadline'gacha bo'lgan eng kech bo'sh slotga** qo'yamiz. Bo'sh slotni DSU bilan O(α) da topish mumkin.\n\n**2-usul (heap, sodda):** deadline bo'yicha o'sish tartibida yuramiz va qabul qilingan foydalarni min-heap'da saqlaymiz. Heap o'lchami deadline'dan oshsa — eng kam foydalisini chiqaramiz.\n\n```java\nArrays.sort(job, (x, y) -> Integer.compare(x[0], y[0]));\nPriorityQueue<Integer> pq = new PriorityQueue<>();\nlong sum = 0;\nfor (int[] j : job) {\n    pq.add(j[1]);\n    sum += j[1];\n    if (pq.size() > j[0]) sum -= pq.poll();\n}\nSystem.out.println(pq.size() + \" \" + sum);\n```\n\nInvariant: heap'dagi ishlarni deadline'lariga sig'dirib joylashtirish mumkin, va ular — shu nuqtagacha mumkin bo'lgan eng foydali to'plam.\n\n## Qaysi qoida qaysi maqsad uchun\n\n| Maqsad | Qoida |\n|---|---|\n| Σ tugash vaqti min | SPT: qisqasi oldin |\n| Σ og'irlikli tugash min | Smith: `t / w` kichigi oldin |\n| Maksimal kechikish min | EDD: deadline bo'yicha |\n| O'z vaqtidagi ishlar soni max | Moore–Hodgson: EDD + eng uzunini chiqarish |\n| Birlik ishlar, foyda max | Deadline bo'yicha + min-heap |\n\n> [!WARN] Ishlar uzunligi har xil **va** foyda ham bor bo'lsa (\"davomiylik + deadline + foyda\") — greedy yetmaydi. Deadline bo'yicha saralab, keyin knapsack DP qilinadi."},{"id":"l06","module":"m3","week":5,"title":"PriorityQueue bilan greedy","mins":55,"viz":["huffman"],"problems":["p12","p13"],"goals":["Java PriorityQueue'ni min va max rejimida ishlatish","Huffman / ropes birlashtirish va uning isbotini bilish","Ikki to'plamli greedy (IPO) yozish"],"summary":"\"Hozirgi eng yaxshi\" o'zgarib tursa — heap. Huffman, IPO va lazy deletion.","md":"## Qachon heap kerak?\n\nSaralash bir marta tartib beradi. Lekin ko'p masalalarda **tanlovdan keyin yangi element paydo bo'ladi** yoki nomzodlar to'plami o'zgaradi. Har qadamda \"hozir eng yaxshisi\" kerak bo'lsa — `PriorityQueue`.\n\n```java\nPriorityQueue<Integer> minH = new PriorityQueue<>();\nPriorityQueue<Integer> maxH = new PriorityQueue<>(Collections.reverseOrder());\nPriorityQueue<long[]> byFirst = new PriorityQueue<>((x, y) -> Long.compare(x[0], y[0]));\n```\n\n| Amal | Metod | Narx |\n|---|---|---|\n| Qo'shish | `add` / `offer` | O(log n) |\n| Eng kichigini ko'rish | `peek` | O(1) |\n| Eng kichigini olish | `poll` | O(log n) |\n| Ixtiyoriy elementni o'chirish | `remove(obj)` | **O(n)** — qoching |\n\n> [!TIP] Boxing'dan (`Integer`) qochish uchun bir nechta qiymatni bitta `long`ga kodlash mumkin: `(long) value << 20 | index`. Heap tezroq ishlaydi.\n\n## Huffman: arqonlarni birlashtirish\n\nn ta arqon. Ikki arqonni ulash narxi — ularning uzunliklari yig'indisi. Hammasini bittaga ulashning minimal narxi?\n\nGreedy: **har doim ikki eng qisqasini ulang.**\n\n```java\nPriorityQueue<Long> pq = new PriorityQueue<>();\nfor (long x : a) pq.add(x);\nlong cost = 0;\nwhile (pq.size() > 1) {\n    long s = pq.poll() + pq.poll();\n    cost += s;\n    pq.add(s);\n}\n```\n\nNega to'g'ri: ulanishlar ikkilik daraxt hosil qiladi va har arqon uzunligi **daraxtdagi chuqurligicha** marta qo'shiladi. Eng chuqur ikki barg — aka-uka; ularni eng kichik ikki son bilan almashtirish narxni oshirmaydi (exchange). Bu Huffman kodlash bilan aynan bir xil — bitlar soni = chuqurlik × chastota.\n\n> [!NOTE] Slimes (Katak, interval DP) dan farqi: u yerda faqat **qo'shni** bo'laklar birlashadi, shuning uchun greedy emas, DP kerak. Bu yerda istalgan ikkitasi — greedy ishlaydi.\n\n## IPO: ikki to'plamli greedy\n\nKapitalingiz `w`. Har loyiha: talab qilinadigan kapital `c`, foyda `p`. Ko'pi bilan k ta loyiha. Har bajarilgan loyiha foydasi kapitalga qo'shiladi.\n\nGreedy: har qadamda **hozir qurbingiz yetadigan** loyihalar ichidan eng foydalisini oling.\n\n1. Loyihalarni `c` bo'yicha saralang.\n2. Ko'rsatkich bilan `c ≤ w` bo'lganlarning foydasini max-heap'ga soling.\n3. Heap'dan eng kattasini olib, `w` ga qo'shing. k marta takrorlang.\n\n```java\nInteger[] idx = new Integer[n];\nfor (int i = 0; i < n; i++) idx[i] = i;\nArrays.sort(idx, (x, y) -> Integer.compare(cap[x], cap[y]));\nPriorityQueue<Integer> pq = new PriorityQueue<>(Collections.reverseOrder());\nint ptr = 0;\nfor (int step = 0; step < k; step++) {\n    while (ptr < n && cap[idx[ptr]] <= w) pq.add(profit[idx[ptr++]]);\n    if (pq.isEmpty()) break;\n    w += pq.poll();\n}\n```\n\nHar loyiha heap'ga bir marta kiradi: O(n log n).\n\n## Lazy deletion\n\nHeap'dan ixtiyoriy elementni o'chirish qimmat. O'rniga \"o'chirildi\" belgisini qo'yamiz va element tepaga chiqqanda tashlab yuboramiz:\n\n```java\nwhile (!pq.isEmpty() && removed[pq.peek()[1]]) pq.poll();\n```\n\nDijkstra'dagi `if (d > dist[v]) continue;` ham aynan shu g'oya.\n\n## Klassik PQ greedy'lar\n\n| Masala | Heap'da nima |\n|---|---|\n| Huffman / ropes | uzunliklar (min) |\n| Minimal xonalar | tugash vaqtlari (min) |\n| IPO | foydalar (max) |\n| Moore–Hodgson | davomiyliklar (max) |\n| K ta saralangan ro'yxatni birlashtirish | har ro'yxat boshi (min) |\n| Reorganize String | belgi chastotalari (max) |"},{"id":"l07","module":"m3","week":6,"title":"Regret greedy — tanlovni keyinroq tuzatish","mins":60,"viz":[],"problems":["p14","p15"],"goals":["Variantlarni heap'da \"zaxirada\" saqlash g'oyasi","Minimal yoqilg'i quyish masalasi","Buy Low Sell High'dagi ikki marta qo'shish hiylasi"],"summary":"Avval olib qo'yamiz, keyin afsuslansak — eng arzon variantni bekor qilamiz.","md":"## G'oya\n\nOddiy greedy tanlovga qaytmaydi. **Regret greedy** esa qaror qabul qilishni kechiktiradi: o'tib ketgan imkoniyatlarni heap'da saqlaydi va kerak bo'lganda \"o'tmishda aslida shuni tanlagan edim\" deb ulardan foydalanadi. Yoki aksincha — avval olgan narsasini eng kam zarar bilan bekor qiladi.\n\nMoore–Hodgson (5-dars) shunday edi: ishni qabul qilamiz, sig'masa — eng uzunini bekor qilamiz.\n\n## Minimal yoqilg'i quyish\n\nMashina 0 nuqtadan `target` ga boradi, boshlang'ich yoqilg'i `start`, 1 birlik masofa = 1 litr. Yo'lda stansiyalar `(pos, fuel)`. Minimal nechta to'xtash kerak?\n\nQaror \"shu stansiyada to'xtaymanmi?\" ni darhol qilish qiyin. Regret usuli:\n\n1. Yo'lda yuramiz. O'tgan har stansiyaning yoqilg'isini **max-heap**'ga solamiz (\"to'xtashim mumkin edi\").\n2. Keyingi nuqtaga yetib bo'lmasa — heap'dan **eng katta** yoqilg'ini olamiz: \"o'sha stansiyada to'xtagan edim\" deb hisoblaymiz.\n\n```java\nPriorityQueue<Integer> pq = new PriorityQueue<>(Collections.reverseOrder());\nlong reach = start;\nint stops = 0, i = 0;\nwhile (reach < target) {\n    while (i < n && st[i][0] <= reach) pq.add(st[i++][1]);\n    if (pq.isEmpty()) { stops = -1; break; }\n    reach += pq.poll();\n    stops++;\n}\n```\n\nNega eng kattasi? Har to'xtash bitta \"narx\" turadi, shuning uchun har to'xtashda imkon qadar ko'p yoqilg'i olish — eng uzoqqa yetkazadi (exchange argument).\n\n## Buy Low Sell High\n\nHar kuni aksiya narxi `p[i]`. Har kuni bitta aksiya sotib olish, bitta sotish yoki hech narsa qilmaslik mumkin. Oxirida qo'lda aksiya qolmasin. Maksimal foyda?\n\nHiyla: min-heap'da \"sotib olish imkoniyatlari\". Har kun `p`:\n\n- heap boshi `x < p` bo'lsa — `x` da olib, `p` da sotamiz: `ans += p - x`, `x` ni chiqaramiz va **`p` ni ikki marta** qo'shamiz.\n- aks holda `p` ni bir marta qo'shamiz.\n\n```java\nPriorityQueue<Long> pq = new PriorityQueue<>();\nlong ans = 0;\nfor (long p : price) {\n    if (!pq.isEmpty() && pq.peek() < p) {\n        ans += p - pq.poll();\n        pq.add(p);\n    }\n    pq.add(p);\n}\n```\n\nNega ikki marta? Bitta nusxa — \"bugun sotdim, lekin afsuslansam, keyinroq qimmatroq narxda sotaman\" variantini saqlaydi: keyin `q > p` kelsa, `q - p` qo'shiladi va jami `(p - x) + (q - p) = q - x` — xuddi `x` da olib, `q` da sotgandek. Ikkinchi nusxa — \"bugun sotib olish\" imkoniyati.\n\n> [!TIP] Regret greedy belgisi: tanlov keyinroq ma'lum bo'ladigan ma'lumotga bog'liq, lekin har bekor qilish \"lokal\" va narxi aniq hisoblanadi.\n\n## Qayerda uchraydi\n\n| Masala | Heap'da | Bekor qilish |\n|---|---|---|\n| Course Schedule III | davomiyliklar (max) | eng uzun ishni |\n| Minimum Refueling Stops | yoqilg'ilar (max) | — (kechiktirilgan tanlov) |\n| Buy Low Sell High | narxlar (min) | avvalgi sotuvni |\n| CSES Tasks with K changes, \"Scheduling with profits\" | foydalar (min) | eng kam foydalisini |"},{"id":"l08","module":"m4","week":7,"title":"Ikki ko'rsatkich va multiset","mins":55,"viz":[],"problems":["p16","p17","p18"],"goals":["Saralangan ikki uchni juftlash greedy'sini isbotlash","Java'da TreeMap'ni multiset sifatida ishlatish","floorKey / higherKey bilan \"eng mos\" elementni olish"],"summary":"Ferris Wheel, Apartments, Concert Tickets — juftlash va \"eng mos qolganini olish\".","md":"## Eng og'irini eng yengili bilan\n\n**Ferris Wheel**: har kabinaga ko'pi bilan 2 bola, umumiy og'irlik ≤ x. Minimal kabinalar?\n\nGreedy: saralab, eng og'ir bolani olamiz. Uni **eng yengil** bola bilan juftlash mumkin bo'lsa — juftlaymiz, aks holda yolg'iz o'tqazamiz.\n\n```java\nArrays.sort(w);\nint i = 0, j = n - 1, gond = 0;\nwhile (i <= j) {\n    if (i < j && w[i] + w[j] <= x) i++;\n    j--;\n    gond++;\n}\n```\n\nIsbot (exchange): eng og'ir bola `H` hech kim bilan sig'masa, u baribir yolg'iz o'tiradi. Sig'sa, optimal yechimni olamiz. Agar unda `H` yolg'iz bo'lsa, `L` ni (eng yengilni) uning yoniga ko'chiramiz — kabinalar soni oshmaydi. Agar `H` ning sherigi `y`, `L` ning sherigi esa `z` bo'lsa, `y` va `L` ni almashtiramiz: `H + L ≤ x` (tekshirdik), `y + z ≤ y + H ≤ x` (chunki `z ≤ H`). Natija yomonlashmadi, endi u greedy bilan bir xil boshlanadi.\n\n## Ikki ro'yxatni juftlash\n\n**Apartments**: n ta xaridor (kerakli o'lcham `a`), m ta kvartira (`b`). `|a - b| ≤ k` bo'lsa mos. Maksimal juftliklar?\n\nIkkalasini saralab, ikki ko'rsatkich: eng kichik xaridor va eng kichik kvartira.\n\n```java\nArrays.sort(a);\nArrays.sort(b);\nint i = 0, j = 0, cnt = 0;\nwhile (i < n && j < m) {\n    if (Math.abs(a[i] - b[j]) <= k) { cnt++; i++; j++; }\n    else if (b[j] < a[i] - k) j++;\n    else i++;\n}\n```\n\nKvartira juda kichik bo'lsa — u hech kimga yaramaydi (keyingilar yanada katta xohlaydi). Xaridor juda kichik xohlasa — unga hech qaysi qolgan kvartira yaramaydi.\n\n## Java'da multiset\n\nC++ `multiset` ning Java'dagi o'rnini `TreeMap<Integer, Integer>` (qiymat → soni) bosadi:\n\n```java\nstatic TreeMap<Integer, Integer> ms = new TreeMap<>();\n\nstatic void add(int x) { ms.merge(x, 1, Integer::sum); }\n\nstatic void remove(int x) {\n    int c = ms.get(x);\n    if (c == 1) ms.remove(x);\n    else ms.put(x, c - 1);\n}\n```\n\n| Kerak | Metod |\n|---|---|\n| ≤ x eng kattasi | `floorKey(x)` |\n| < x eng kattasi | `lowerKey(x)` |\n| ≥ x eng kichigi | `ceilingKey(x)` |\n| > x eng kichigi | `higherKey(x)` |\n| Eng kichik / katta | `firstKey()` / `lastKey()` |\n\nTopilmasa `null` qaytadi — `Integer` bilan tekshiring, `int`ga avtomatik o'tkazsangiz NullPointerException.\n\n## Concert Tickets\n\nChiptalar narxlari ro'yxati. Har xaridor `t` dan oshmaydigan **eng qimmat** chiptani oladi (yo'q bo'lsa -1). Bu greedy masalaning shartida berilgan, bizdan faqat tez bajarish talab qilinadi: `floorKey(t)` + o'chirish, har biri O(log n).\n\n```java\nStringBuilder out = new StringBuilder();\nfor (int q : t) {\n    Integer p = ms.floorKey(q);\n    if (p == null) out.append(-1).append('\\n');\n    else { out.append(p).append('\\n'); remove(p); }\n}\nSystem.out.print(out);\n```\n\n> [!TIP] \"Eng mos qolgan elementni olib, uni o'chirish\" — greedy'ning juda tez-tez uchraydigan shakli. Har safar TreeMap haqida o'ylang."},{"id":"l09","module":"m4","week":7,"title":"Sakrash, yetib borish va aylana","mins":45,"viz":["jump"],"problems":["p19","p20"],"goals":["\"Eng uzoq yetish\" invariantini yuritish","Jump Game II'ni BFS qatlamlari sifatida ko'rish","Gas Station isbotini tushunish"],"summary":"Jump Game I/II, Gas Station va qamrov masalalari — bitta o'tishda.","md":"## Jump Game: yetib bora olamanmi?\n\n`a[i]` — i dan ko'pi bilan nechta qadam sakrash mumkin. 0 dan oxirgisiga yetish mumkinmi? Faqat bitta son kerak: **hozirgacha yetish mumkin bo'lgan eng uzoq indeks.**\n\n```java\nint far = 0;\nfor (int i = 0; i < n && i <= far; i++) far = Math.max(far, i + a[i]);\nboolean ok = far >= n - 1;\n```\n\n## Jump Game II: minimal sakrashlar\n\nBu aslida BFS: 0-qatlam — `[0, 0]`, 1-qatlam — bitta sakrashda yetiladigan indekslar, va h.k. Qatlamlar **ketma-ket oraliqlar** bo'lgani uchun navbat kerak emas:\n\n```java\nint jumps = 0, curEnd = 0, far = 0;\nfor (int i = 0; i < n - 1; i++) {\n    far = Math.max(far, i + a[i]);\n    if (i == curEnd) {\n        jumps++;\n        curEnd = far;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n`curEnd` — joriy qatlam oxiri. Unga yetganda sakrash majburiy, va keyingi qatlam `far` gacha boradi. Bu intervallarni qamrash (3-dars) bilan bir xil g'oya.\n\n## Gas Station\n\nAylana yo'lda n ta stansiya: i-da `gas[i]` litr olasiz, i → i+1 ga `cost[i]` litr ketadi. Qaysi stansiyadan boshlasangiz to'liq aylana olasiz?\n\nIkki fakt:\n\n1. `Σgas < Σcost` bo'lsa — javob yo'q.\n2. Aks holda javob bor, va uni bitta o'tishda topamiz: boshlanish nuqtasidan yuramiz; bak manfiy bo'lib qolsa, boshlanishni **keyingi stansiyaga** ko'chiramiz.\n\n```java\nlong total = 0, tank = 0;\nint start = 0;\nfor (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n    long d = gas[i] - cost[i];\n    total += d;\n    tank += d;\n    if (tank < 0) { start = i + 1; tank = 0; }\n}\nSystem.out.println(total < 0 ? -1 : start);\n```\n\nNega oraliqdagi stansiyalarni tekshirmaymiz? `s` dan boshlab `i` da yiqildik. `s` va `i` orasidagi har `j` ga `s` dan yetganda bakda `≥ 0` bor edi; `j` dan boshlash esa bakni `0` dan boshlash demak — yanada yomon. Demak ularning hech biri ham `i` dan o'tolmaydi.\n\n> [!NOTE] Gas Station \"maksimal prefiks yig'indi\" g'oyasiga yaqin: boshlanish — prefiks yig'indi eng past bo'lgan nuqtadan keyingisi.\n\n## Qamrov masalalari bir xil\n\n| Masala | Qatlamlar |\n|---|---|\n| Jump Game II | `[i, i + a[i]]` |\n| Video Stitching | kliplar `[s, e]` |\n| Minimum Taps to Water a Garden | `[i - r, i + r]` |\n\nHammasini \"boshlanish ≤ hozirgi qamrov bo'lganlar ichidan eng uzoqqa yetadiganini ol\" bilan yechiladi."},{"id":"l10","module":"m5","week":8,"title":"Satr greedy va monoton stek","mins":55,"viz":["stack"],"problems":["p21","p22"],"goals":["Leksikografik tartibda \"eng chapdagi pozitsiya hal qiladi\" tamoyili","Monoton stek bilan raqam/harf olib tashlash","Oxirgi uchrash indeksidan foydalanish"],"summary":"Remove K Digits, eng kichik distinct subsequence va \"chapdagi belgi muhimroq\" qoidasi.","md":"## Leksikografik greedy tamoyili\n\nIkki satr (yoki bir xil uzunlikdagi son) solishtirilganda **birinchi farqli pozitsiya** hal qiladi. Shuning uchun: chapdagi pozitsiyani imkon qadar yaxshilang, keyin qolganlari haqida o'ylang. Bu deyarli barcha \"eng kichik/katta satr tuzing\" masalalarining kaliti.\n\n## Remove K Digits\n\nSondan aynan k ta raqamni o'chirib, eng kichik sonni hosil qiling.\n\n`1432219`, k = 3 → `1219`. Qoida: chapdan yuramiz; agar joriy raqam stek tepasidagidan **kichik** bo'lsa va hali o'chirish huquqi bo'lsa — tepadagini o'chiramiz (chapdagi pozitsiya kichrayadi).\n\n```java\nStringBuilder st = new StringBuilder();\nfor (char c : num.toCharArray()) {\n    while (k > 0 && st.length() > 0 && st.charAt(st.length() - 1) > c) {\n        st.deleteCharAt(st.length() - 1);\n        k--;\n    }\n    st.append(c);\n}\nst.setLength(st.length() - k);\nint i = 0;\nwhile (i < st.length() - 1 && st.charAt(i) == '0') i++;\nString res = st.substring(i);\nSystem.out.println(res.isEmpty() ? \"0\" : res);\n```\n\nStek doim **kamaymaydigan** (non-decreasing) ketma-ketlik bo'lib qoladi. Oxirida k qolsa — eng katta raqamlar oxirda, shuning uchun oxiridan kesamiz.\n\n## Smallest Subsequence of Distinct Characters\n\nHar belgi aynan bir marta qatnashadigan, leksikografik eng kichik subsequence. `cbacdcbc` → `acdb`.\n\nRemove K Digits'ga o'xshash, lekin tepadagi belgini faqat **u keyinroq yana uchrasa** olib tashlash mumkin:\n\n```java\nint[] last = new int[26];\nfor (int i = 0; i < s.length(); i++) last[s.charAt(i) - 'a'] = i;\nboolean[] in = new boolean[26];\nStringBuilder st = new StringBuilder();\nfor (int i = 0; i < s.length(); i++) {\n    char c = s.charAt(i);\n    if (in[c - 'a']) continue;\n    while (st.length() > 0) {\n        char top = st.charAt(st.length() - 1);\n        if (top > c && last[top - 'a'] > i) {\n            st.deleteCharAt(st.length() - 1);\n            in[top - 'a'] = false;\n        } else break;\n    }\n    st.append(c);\n    in[c - 'a'] = true;\n}\n```\n\n## Bitta almashtirish bilan eng katta son\n\nLeetCode 670: ikki raqamni bir marta almashtirib eng katta son. Chapdan birinchi pozitsiya `i` ni topamiz, undan o'ngda kattaroq raqam bor; o'sha raqamlardan eng kattasining **eng oxirgi** uchrashini olib almashtiramiz (oxirgisi — kichik raqamni imkon qadar o'ngga yuborish uchun).\n\n```java\nchar[] d = String.valueOf(x).toCharArray();\nint[] last = new int[10];\nfor (int i = 0; i < d.length; i++) last[d[i] - '0'] = i;\nouter:\nfor (int i = 0; i < d.length; i++) {\n    for (int dg = 9; dg > d[i] - '0'; dg--) {\n        if (last[dg] > i) {\n            char t = d[i]; d[i] = d[last[dg]]; d[last[dg]] = t;\n            break outer;\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n> [!TIP] Java'da satrni stek sifatida yuritish uchun `StringBuilder` (`append`, `deleteCharAt(len-1)`, `charAt(len-1)`) — tez va qulay. `String +=` tsiklda O(n²).\n\n## Monoton stek oilasi\n\n| Masala | Stek monotonligi |\n|---|---|\n| Remove K Digits | o'suvchi |\n| Remove Duplicate Letters | o'suvchi + \"keyin bormi\" sharti |\n| Next Greater Element | kamayuvchi |\n| Largest Rectangle in Histogram | o'suvchi |\n| Create Maximum Number | kamayuvchi (k ta element tanlash) |"},{"id":"l11","module":"m6","week":9,"title":"MST — Kruskal va Prim","mins":65,"viz":["kruskal"],"problems":["p23"],"goals":["Cut property'ni tushunish va isbotlash","Kruskal'ni DSU bilan yozish","Prim'ni PriorityQueue bilan yozish"],"summary":"Minimal spanning tree — graflardagi eng mashhur greedy va uning isboti.","md":"## Masala\n\nBog'langan, og'irlikli, yo'naltirilmagan graf. Barcha tugunlarni bog'laydigan va qirralari yig'indisi minimal bo'lgan qism-daraxt (MST) kerak. Masalan, shaharlar orasida eng arzon yo'l tarmog'i.\n\n## Cut property\n\nTugunlarni ikki guruhga bo'lamiz (kesim). Guruhlar orasidagi qirralardan **eng yengili** biror MST'da albatta bor.\n\nIsbot (exchange): MST `T` da bu qirra `e` yo'q deylik. `e` ni `T` ga qo'shsak, sikl hosil bo'ladi va u kesimni yana bir qirra `f` bilan kesib o'tadi. `w(e) ≤ w(f)`, shuning uchun `T - f + e` ham daraxt va og'irligi oshmagan. Demak `e` ni o'z ichiga olgan MST bor.\n\nKruskal ham, Prim ham shu xossani turli kesimlar uchun qo'llaydi.\n\n## Kruskal\n\nQirralarni og'irlik bo'yicha saralaymiz. Har qirrani, agar u **sikl hosil qilmasa**, olamiz. Sikl tekshiruvi — DSU (Disjoint Set Union).\n\n```java\nstatic int[] par, sz;\n\nstatic int find(int x) {\n    while (par[x] != x) {\n        par[x] = par[par[x]];\n        x = par[x];\n    }\n    return x;\n}\n\nstatic boolean union(int a, int b) {\n    a = find(a);\n    b = find(b);\n    if (a == b) return false;\n    if (sz[a] < sz[b]) { int t = a; a = b; b = t; }\n    par[b] = a;\n    sz[a] += sz[b];\n    return true;\n}\n```\n\n```java\nArrays.sort(e, (x, y) -> Integer.compare(x[2], y[2]));\nlong total = 0;\nint used = 0;\nfor (int[] ed : e) {\n    if (union(ed[0], ed[1])) {\n        total += ed[2];\n        used++;\n    }\n}\nSystem.out.println(used == n - 1 ? String.valueOf(total) : \"IMPOSSIBLE\");\n```\n\nMurakkablik O(m log m). Iterativ `find` (path halving) — Java'da rekursiyasiz, stack xavfi yo'q.\n\n## Prim\n\nBitta tugundan boshlab daraxtni o'stiramiz: har qadamda daraxt va qolgan tugunlar orasidagi **eng yengil** qirrani qo'shamiz (kesim — \"daraxt / qolganlar\").\n\n```java\nboolean[] in = new boolean[n];\nPriorityQueue<long[]> pq = new PriorityQueue<>((x, y) -> Long.compare(x[0], y[0]));\npq.add(new long[]{0, 0});\nlong total = 0;\nint cnt = 0;\nwhile (!pq.isEmpty() && cnt < n) {\n    long[] cur = pq.poll();\n    int v = (int) cur[1];\n    if (in[v]) continue;\n    in[v] = true;\n    total += cur[0];\n    cnt++;\n    for (int[] ed : adj[v]) if (!in[ed[0]]) pq.add(new long[]{ed[1], ed[0]});\n}\n```\n\n| | Kruskal | Prim |\n|---|---|---|\n| Asosiy struktura | saralash + DSU | PriorityQueue |\n| Murakkablik | O(m log m) | O(m log n) |\n| Qachon qulay | qirralar ro'yxati berilgan | zich graf, qo'shnilik ro'yxati |\n\n## MST xossalari\n\n- **Minimax yo'l**: MST'dagi u→v yo'l — \"eng og'ir qirrasi minimal\" bo'lgan yo'l. \"Ikki shahar orasida eng og'ir qirrani minimallashtiring\" masalalari MST'ga keladi.\n- Barcha og'irliklar har xil bo'lsa, MST yagona.\n- Maksimal spanning tree — teskari tartibda saralash."},{"id":"l12","module":"m6","week":10,"title":"Dijkstra — eng yaqinini birinchi","mins":55,"viz":["dijkstra"],"problems":["p24"],"goals":["Dijkstra greedy ekanini va nega ishlashini tushunish","Manfiy qirrada nega buzilishini ko'rsatish","Java'da lazy deletion bilan tez Dijkstra yozish"],"summary":"Eng qisqa yo'l: eng yaqin tugun yakuniy — manfiy qirra bo'lmasa.","md":"## Greedy qadam\n\nDijkstra har qadamda **hali yakunlanmagan tugunlar ichidan masofasi eng kichigini** oladi va uning masofasini yakuniy deb e'lon qiladi. Bu greedy: keyinroq kamroq masofa topilmaydi deb ishonadi.\n\nNega to'g'ri: `v` — eng yaqin yakunlanmagan tugun, `dist[v] = D`. Boshqa yo'l bilan `v` ga kamroqqa borish uchun avval biror yakunlanmagan `u` dan o'tish kerak, lekin `dist[u] ≥ D` va qirralar manfiy emas — demak bu yo'l `≥ D`.\n\n## Manfiy qirra buzadi\n\n`1 → 2` (2), `1 → 3` (5), `3 → 2` (-4). Dijkstra 2 ni masofa 2 bilan yakunlaydi, lekin `1 → 3 → 2` = 1. \"Kelajak yo'q\" degan greedy taxmin manfiy qirra bilan ishlamaydi. Bunda Bellman–Ford kerak.\n\n## Java'da Dijkstra\n\n```java\nlong[] dist = new long[n];\nArrays.fill(dist, Long.MAX_VALUE);\ndist[0] = 0;\nPriorityQueue<long[]> pq = new PriorityQueue<>((x, y) -> Long.compare(x[0], y[0]));\npq.add(new long[]{0, 0});\nwhile (!pq.isEmpty()) {\n    long[] cur = pq.poll();\n    int v = (int) cur[1];\n    if (cur[0] > dist[v]) continue;\n    for (int[] ed : adj[v]) {\n        int u = ed[0];\n        long nd = cur[0] + ed[1];\n        if (nd < dist[u]) {\n            dist[u] = nd;\n            pq.add(new long[]{nd, u});\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n`if (cur[0] > dist[v]) continue;` — lazy deletion: heap'da eskirgan yozuvlar qoladi, ularni olinganda tashlab yuboramiz. `decrease-key` kerak emas.\n\n> [!WARN] Masofalar `long` bo'lsin: 10^5 qirra × 10^9 og'irlik = 10^14.\n\n## Tezlik uchun\n\n- `List<int[]>[]` o'rniga massivlarda qo'shnilik ro'yxati (`head`, `next`, `to`, `w`) — 2–3 marta tez.\n- `long[]` juftlik o'rniga bitta `long`: `dist << 20 | v` (dist ≤ 2^43 bo'lsa).\n- Javobni `StringBuilder` bilan chiqarish.\n\n## Variantlar\n\n| Masala | O'zgarish |\n|---|---|\n| Ko'p manbali | boshida barcha manbalarni `dist = 0` bilan heap'ga |\n| 0-1 og'irliklar | deque bilan 0-1 BFS, O(n + m) |\n| Holatli graf | tugun = (shahar, kupon ishlatildimi) — CSES Flight Discount |\n| Eng qisqa yo'llar soni | `dist` teng bo'lsa `cnt[u] += cnt[v]` |"},{"id":"l13","module":"m7","week":10,"title":"Konstruktiv va matematik greedy","mins":55,"viz":[],"problems":["p25","p26"],"goals":["Prefiks yetish invarianti (Missing Coin Sum)","Multiset bilan Towers va uning LIS bilan bog'liqligi","Codeforces konstruktiv masalalariga yondashuv"],"summary":"Invariantlar, \"eng cheklangan joydan boshlash\" va javobni bosqichma-bosqich qurish.","md":"## Missing Coin Sum\n\nTangalar berilgan. Ularning qism-to'plamlari yig'indisi sifatida hosil qilib **bo'lmaydigan** eng kichik musbat son?\n\nSaralaymiz. Invariant: birinchi i ta tanga bilan `[1, S]` dagi **barcha** sonlar hosil bo'ladi (S — ular yig'indisi). Keyingi tanga `c`:\n\n- `c ≤ S + 1` bo'lsa, `[1, S + c]` ning hammasi hosil bo'ladi (eskilari + har biriga `c` qo'shib).\n- `c > S + 1` bo'lsa, `S + 1` ni hech qachon hosil qilib bo'lmaydi (keyingi tangalar yanada katta).\n\n```java\nArrays.sort(c);\nlong reach = 0;\nfor (long x : c) {\n    if (x > reach + 1) break;\n    reach += x;\n}\nSystem.out.println(reach + 1);\n```\n\n## Towers\n\nKublar ketma-ket keladi. Har kubni **o'zidan katta** kub ustiga qo'yish mumkin yoki yangi minora boshlanadi. Minimal minoralar soni?\n\nGreedy: kubni tepasi kubdan katta bo'lgan minoralar ichidan **tepasi eng kichigiga** qo'yamiz (eng \"tor\" mos joy) — katta tepalar keyingi katta kublar uchun qoladi.\n\n```java\nTreeMap<Integer, Integer> tops = new TreeMap<>();\nfor (int k : cubes) {\n    Integer t = tops.higherKey(k);\n    if (t != null) {\n        if (tops.merge(t, -1, Integer::sum) == 0) tops.remove(t);\n    }\n    tops.merge(k, 1, Integer::sum);\n}\nint towers = 0;\nfor (int v : tops.values()) towers += v;\n```\n\n> [!NOTE] Bu \"patience sorting\". Minoralar soni = eng uzun **kamaymaydigan** subsequence uzunligi (Dilworth teoremasi). LIS'ning O(n log n) algoritmi ham aynan shu g'oya.\n\n## Konstruktiv masalalar\n\nCodeforces'da \"shunday massiv/satr/graf tuzing\" turidagi masalalar ko'p uchraydi va ularning aksariyati greedy. Yondashuv:\n\n1. **Kichik holatlarni qo'lda yeching** (n = 1..5) va naqsh izlang.\n2. **Eng cheklangan joydan boshlang.** Eng katta element, eng kam variantli pozitsiya, eng kichik deadline — ular birinchi qaror qilinadi.\n3. **Invariant topin.** Har qadamdan keyin nima saqlanadi? (yig'indi juftligi, qolgan elementlar soni, ...) Invariant ko'pincha \"javob yo'q\" holatini ham ko'rsatadi.\n4. **Ikki uchdan quring.** Kichik va katta elementlarni navbatma-navbat qo'yish ko'p masalada ishlaydi.\n\n## Juftlik va qoldiqlar\n\n- `1..n` ni yig'indisi teng ikki guruhga bo'lish (CSES Two Sets): `n(n+1)/2` toq bo'lsa — yo'q. Aks holda kattadan boshlab, joriy maqsaddan oshmasa birinchi guruhga qo'shamiz.\n- \"Massivni bir xil qilish uchun minimal amallar\": median (2-dars) yoki o'rtacha qiymat — amal turiga qarab.\n\n```java\nlong target = (long) n * (n + 1) / 4;\nList<Integer> first = new ArrayList<>();\nfor (int x = n; x >= 1; x--) {\n    if (x <= target) {\n        first.add(x);\n        target -= x;\n    }\n}\n```"},{"id":"l14","module":"m8","week":11,"title":"Javob bo'yicha binary search + greedy tekshiruv","mins":55,"viz":[],"problems":["p27","p28"],"goals":["Monoton predikatni ko'rish","check(x) ni greedy bilan yozish","Java'da long bilan xavfsiz binary search"],"summary":"\"Minimal maksimum\" va \"minimal vaqt\" masalalari: javobni taxmin qilib, greedy bilan tekshirish.","md":"## G'oya\n\nKo'p masalada optimal javobni to'g'ridan-to'g'ri topish qiyin, lekin **\"javob ≤ x bo'lishi mumkinmi?\"** degan savolga greedy bilan oson javob beriladi. Agar bu savol monoton bo'lsa (x mumkin bo'lsa, x+1 ham mumkin) — javob ustida binary search.\n\nBelgilar: \"**minimal** vaqt\", \"maksimumni **minimallashtiring**\", \"minimumni **maksimallashtiring**\".\n\n## Shablon\n\n```java\nlong lo = 0, hi = (long) 1e18;\nwhile (lo < hi) {\n    long mid = lo + (hi - lo) / 2;\n    if (check(mid)) hi = mid;\n    else lo = mid + 1;\n}\nSystem.out.println(lo);\n```\n\n`lo + (hi - lo) / 2` — `(lo + hi) / 2` overflow'idan qochish uchun.\n\n## Factory Machines\n\nn ta mashina, i-mashina bitta mahsulotni `k[i]` sekundda yasaydi. t ta mahsulot uchun minimal vaqt?\n\n`check(T)`: T vaqtda jami `Σ T / k[i]` ta mahsulot. Bu `≥ t` mi? Greedy shu yerda: har mashina T davomida to'xtovsiz ishlaydi.\n\n```java\nstatic boolean check(long T) {\n    long made = 0;\n    for (int x : k) {\n        made += T / x;\n        if (made >= t) return true;\n    }\n    return false;\n}\n```\n\n> [!WARN] `made >= t` bo'lishi bilan to'xtating: aks holda `Σ T / k[i]` 2·10^5 × 10^18 bo'lib `long`dan chiqadi.\n\n`hi` uchun `min(k) · t` yetarli: eng tez mashina yolg'iz o'zi shu vaqtda ulguradi.\n\n## Array Division\n\nMassivni k ta ketma-ket bo'lakka bo'ling, bo'laklar yig'indisining **maksimumi** minimal bo'lsin.\n\n`check(S)`: har bo'lak yig'indisi `≤ S` bo'ladigan qilib necha bo'lak kerak? Greedy: chapdan yuramiz va bo'lakka imkon qadar ko'p element qo'shamiz; sig'masa — yangi bo'lak.\n\n```java\nstatic boolean check(long S) {\n    int parts = 1;\n    long cur = 0;\n    for (int x : a) {\n        if (x > S) return false;\n        if (cur + x > S) { parts++; cur = 0; }\n        cur += x;\n    }\n    return parts <= k;\n}\n```\n\nNega greedy to'g'ri: bo'lakni imkon qadar uzun qilish keyingi bo'laklarga kamroq element qoldiradi — hech qachon yomonlashtirmaydi (\"greedy stays ahead\").\n\n## Aggressive Cows\n\nOmbor o'rinlari berilgan, c ta sigirni joylashtiring, **eng yaqin ikki sigir orasidagi masofa** maksimal bo'lsin. `check(D)`: saralangan o'rinlarda chapdan boshlab, oldingi sigirdan ≥ D bo'lgan birinchi joyga qo'yamiz. c ta sig'sa — D mumkin. Bu safar \"maksimal mumkin\" qidiriladi:\n\n```java\nlong lo = 0, hi = pos[n - 1] - pos[0];\nwhile (lo < hi) {\n    long mid = lo + (hi - lo + 1) / 2;\n    if (check(mid)) lo = mid;\n    else hi = mid - 1;\n}\n```\n\n`+ 1` — aks holda `lo = mid` cheksiz siklga tushadi."},{"id":"l15","module":"m9","week":11,"title":"Matroid, greedy chegaralari va musobaqa strategiyasi","mins":50,"viz":[],"problems":[],"goals":["Greedy qachon kafolatlangan to'g'ri ekanini (matroid) bilish","Greedy ishlamaydigan klassik masalalarni tanish","Musobaqada greedy'ni tez tekshirish tartibi"],"summary":"Matroid nazariyasi qisqacha, greedy + DP gibridlari va musobaqa uchun cheklist.","md":"## Matroid: greedy'ning nazariy asosi\n\nElementlar to'plami va \"mustaqil\" deb ataladigan qism-to'plamlar oilasi **matroid** bo'ladi, agar:\n\n1. Mustaqil to'plamning har qism-to'plami ham mustaqil (merosiylik).\n2. `A`, `B` mustaqil va `|A| < |B|` bo'lsa, `B` da shunday `x` borki, `A + x` ham mustaqil (almashtirish xossasi).\n\n**Teorema:** matroidda \"og'irlik bo'yicha kamayish tartibida olamiz, mustaqillik buzilmasa\" greedy'si maksimal og'irlikli mustaqil to'plamni beradi.\n\n| Matroid | Mustaqil to'plam | Greedy |\n|---|---|---|\n| Graf (graphic) | siklsiz qirralar | Kruskal |\n| Uniform | ko'pi bilan k ta element | eng katta k tasini olish |\n| Scheduling | deadline'larga sig'adigan birlik ishlar | 5-darsdagi deadline + foyda |\n| Chiziqli (linear) | chiziqli erkli vektorlar | XOR basis |\n\n> [!NOTE] Agar masaladagi \"ruxsat etilgan to'plamlar\" matroid bo'lsa — greedy isbotsiz ishlaydi. Agar almashtirish xossasi buzilsa (masalan, 0/1 knapsack) — greedy ishonchsiz.\n\n## Greedy ishlamaydigan klassikalar\n\n| Masala | Tabiiy greedy | Nega xato | Nima kerak |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 0/1 knapsack | qiymat/og'irlik nisbati | bo'lib bo'lmaydi | DP |\n| Coin change (ixtiyoriy tangalar) | eng katta tanga | {1, 3, 4}, 6 | DP |\n| Eng uzun yo'l | eng og'ir qirra | kelajak hisobga olinmaydi | DAG DP |\n| TSP | eng yaqin shahar | oxirida qimmat qaytish | bitmask DP |\n| Slimes (qo'shnilar) | eng kichik juftlik | faqat qo'shnilar | interval DP |\n| Weighted interval scheduling | eng erta tugash | og'irliklar | saralash + DP + binary search |\n\n## Greedy + DP gibridi\n\nKo'p qiyin masalada **exchange argument tartibni beradi, DP esa tanlovni**:\n\n1. Exchange argument bilan elementlarni qaysi tartibda ko'rib chiqish kerakligini aniqlang (masalan, deadline bo'yicha).\n2. Shu tartibda knapsack yoki boshqa DP qiling.\n\nMisol: davomiylik, deadline va foydali ishlar — deadline bo'yicha saralab, `dp[vaqt]` knapsack. Yana bir misol: qutilarni ustma-ust qo'yish — `kuch + og'irlik` bo'yicha saralab, DP.\n\n## Musobaqa cheklisti\n\n1. **Greedy qoidani bir gap bilan yozing.** \"Eng erta tugaydiganini olaman.\"\n2. **3 ta qarshi misol izlang:** teng qiymatlar, bitta juda katta element, ikki variant teng ko'rinadigan holat.\n3. **Qo'shni juftlik testi:** ikki elementni almashtirsam yaxshilanadimi? Comparator shu yerdan.\n4. **Shubha bo'lsa — stress test.** Brute force 15 qatordan oshmaydi, 2 daqiqada yoziladi.\n5. **Java tekshiruvi:**\n   - comparator'da ayirma yo'q (`Integer.compare`);\n   - `Arrays.sort(int[])` dan oldin shuffle (Codeforces hack);\n   - yig'indilar `long`;\n   - `TreeMap` metodlari `null` qaytarishi mumkin;\n   - teng elementlar (ties) tartibi javobga ta'sir qiladimi?\n\n## Keyingi qadamlar\n\n- **CSES → Sorting and Searching** bo'limi: deyarli hammasi greedy, ikki ko'rsatkich va multiset.\n- **Codeforces**: `greedy` tegi, 1200 → 1900 bosqichma-bosqich; `constructive algorithms` tegi bilan birga.\n- **AtCoder ABC** C–D masalalari — qisqa va toza greedy mashqlari."}],"problems":[{"id":"p01","lesson":"l01","title":"Lemonade Change","diff":"Oson","ref":"LeetCode 860","tags":["simulyatsiya","qaytim"],"check":"exact","statement":"Limonad 5 so'm turadi. Navbatda n ta xaridor, har biri 5, 10 yoki 20 lik bitta pul beradi. Boshida kassada pul yo'q. Har bir xaridorga to'g'ri qaytim bera olasizmi?","io":"n (1 ≤ n ≤ 10^5), keyin n ta son (5, 10 yoki 20). `YES` yoki `NO`.","examples":[{"input":"5\n5 5 5 10 20","output":"YES"},{"input":"5\n5 5 10 10 20","output":"NO"}],"hints":["Faqat 5 va 10 liklar sonini bilish yetarli — 20 lik hech qachon qaytimga ketmaydi.","20 ga qaytim 15: ikki xil usul bor.","Qaysi kupyura \"universalroq\"?"],"idea":"20 uchun avval `10 + 5`, bo'lmasa `5 + 5 + 5`.","proof":"5 lik har qanday qaytimda ishlatiladi, 10 lik esa faqat 20 uchun. `10 + 5` bilan qaytarsak, `5 + 5 + 5` ga nisbatan ikkita 5 lik ortiqcha qoladi va bitta 10 lik kam — bu holat har qanday keyingi xaridor uchun yomon emas: 10 lik o'rniga ikkita 5 lik har doim ishlatilishi mumkin, teskarisi esa yo'q.","java":"import java.util.*;\nimport java.io.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n    static StringTokenizer st;\n\n    static String next() throws IOException {\n        while (st == null || !st.hasMoreTokens()) {\n            String line = br.readLine();\n            if (line == null) return null;\n            st = new StringTokenizer(line);\n        }\n        return st.nextToken();\n    }\n\n    static int ni() throws IOException { return Integer.parseInt(next()); }\n    static long nl() throws IOException { return Long.parseLong(next()); }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        int n = ni();\n        int five = 0, ten = 0;\n        boolean ok = true;\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n            int b = ni();\n            if (b == 5) five++;\n            else if (b == 10) {\n                if (five == 0) ok = false;\n                else { five--; ten++; }\n            } else {\n                if (ten > 0 && five > 0) { ten--; five--; }\n                else if (five >= 3) five -= 3;\n                else ok = false;\n            }\n        }\n        System.out.println(ok ? \"YES\" : \"NO\");\n    }\n}","complexity":"Vaqt O(n), xotira O(1)."},{"id":"p02","lesson":"l01","title":"Assign Cookies","diff":"Oson","ref":"LeetCode 455","tags":["saralash","ikki ko'rsatkich"],"check":"exact","statement":"n ta bola, i-bolaning ishtahasi `g[i]`. m ta pechenye, j-sining o'lchami `s[j]`. Bolaga `s[j] ≥ g[i]` bo'lgan pechenye berilsa, u xursand. Har bolaga ko'pi bilan bitta pechenye. Maksimal nechta bola xursand bo'ladi?","io":"n m (1 ≤ n, m ≤ 10^5), keyin `g`, keyin `s` (qiymatlar ≤ 10^9). Javob.","examples":[{"input":"3 2\n1 2 3\n1 1","output":"1"},{"input":"2 3\n1 2\n1 2 3","output":"2"}],"hints":["Ikkala massivni saralang.","Eng kichik pechenyeni kimga berish kerak?","Eng kichik pechenye eng kam ishtahali bolaga yetmasa, u hech kimga yetmaydi."],"idea":"Ikki ko'rsatkich: pechenyelarni o'sish tartibida yuramiz, joriy pechenye joriy (eng kam ishtahali) bolaga yetsa — beramiz.","proof":"Eng kam ishtahali bolani qanoatlantiradigan eng kichik pechenye bilan qanoatlantirish — kattaroq pechenyelarni boshqalarga qoldiradi. Optimal yechimda u bolaga kattaroq pechenye berilgan bo'lsa, ularni almashtirish hech kimni xafa qilmaydi.","java":"import java.util.*;\nimport java.io.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n    static StringTokenizer st;\n\n    static String next() throws IOException {\n        while (st == null || !st.hasMoreTokens()) {\n            String line = br.readLine();\n            if (line == null) return null;\n            st = new StringTokenizer(line);\n        }\n        return st.nextToken();\n    }\n\n    static int ni() throws IOException { return Integer.parseInt(next()); }\n    static long nl() throws IOException { return Long.parseLong(next()); }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        int n = ni(), m = ni();\n        long[] g = new long[n], s = new long[m];\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) g[i] = nl();\n        for (int j = 0; j < m; j++) s[j] = nl();\n        Arrays.sort(g);\n        Arrays.sort(s);\n        int i = 0;\n        for (int j = 0; j < m && i < n; j++) {\n            if (s[j] >= g[i]) i++;\n        }\n        System.out.println(i);\n    }\n}","complexity":"Vaqt O(n log n + m log m), xotira O(n + m)."},{"id":"p03","lesson":"l02","title":"Stick Lengths","diff":"Oson","ref":"CSES 1074","tags":["median","saralash"],"check":"exact","statement":"n ta tayoq, uzunliklari `p[i]`. Bitta tayoqni 1 ga uzaytirish yoki qisqartirish narxi 1. Barcha tayoqlarni bir xil uzunlikka keltirishning minimal narxi?","io":"n (1 ≤ n ≤ 2·10^5), keyin `p` (1 ≤ p ≤ 10^9). Minimal narx.","examples":[{"input":"5\n2 3 1 5 2","output":"5"}],"hints":["Narx — `Σ |p[i] - x|`. Qaysi x?","x ni 1 ga o'ngga sursak, narx qanchaga o'zgaradi?","Javob 10^14 gacha — `long`."],"idea":"x = median (saralangandan keyin o'rtadagi element).","proof":"x dan chapda L ta, o'ngda R ta element bo'lsa, x ni 1 ga o'ngga surish narxni `L - R` ga o'zgartiradi. L < R bo'lsa o'ngga surish foydali, L > R bo'lsa chapga. Medianda L va R muvozanatda — yaxshilab bo'lmaydi.","java":"import java.util.*;\nimport java.io.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n    static StringTokenizer st;\n\n    static String next() throws IOException {\n        while (st == null || !st.hasMoreTokens()) {\n            String line = br.readLine();\n            if (line == null) return null;\n            st = new StringTokenizer(line);\n        }\n        return st.nextToken();\n    }\n\n    static int ni() throws IOException { return Integer.parseInt(next()); }\n    static long nl() throws IOException { return Long.parseLong(next()); }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        int n = ni();\n        long[] p = new long[n];\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) p[i] = nl();\n        Arrays.sort(p);\n        long med = p[n / 2], cost = 0;\n        for (long x : p) cost += Math.abs(x - med);\n        System.out.println(cost);\n    }\n}","complexity":"Vaqt O(n log n), xotira O(n)."},{"id":"p04","lesson":"l03","title":"Movie Festival","diff":"Oson","ref":"CSES 1629","tags":["intervallar","activity selection"],"check":"exact","statement":"Festivalda n ta film, har biri `[a, b)` vaqtda. Filmni boshidan oxirigacha ko'rish kerak, bir vaqtda faqat bitta. Maksimal nechta filmni to'liq ko'rish mumkin? Bir film tugagan paytda boshqasi boshlansa — ikkalasini ham ko'rish mumkin.","io":"n (1 ≤ n ≤ 2·10^5), keyin n qatorda `a b` (1 ≤ a < b ≤ 10^9). Maksimal filmlar soni.","examples":[{"input":"3\n3 5\n4 9\n5 8","output":"2"}],"hints":["Qaysi kalit bo'yicha saralash kerak: boshlanish, uzunlik yoki tugash?","Eng erta boshlanadigan uzun bo'lishi mumkin.","Eng erta tugaydiganini olsak, qolganlar uchun ko'proq vaqt qoladi."],"idea":"Tugash vaqti bo'yicha saralab, `a ≥ lastEnd` bo'lsa olamiz.","proof":"\"Greedy stays ahead\": greedy tanlagan k-film optimal yechimning k-filmidan kechroq tugamaydi (induksiya). Demak greedy kamida optimalcha film oladi.","java":"import java.util.*;\nimport java.io.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n    static StringTokenizer st;\n\n    static String next() throws IOException {\n        while (st == null || !st.hasMoreTokens()) {\n            String line = br.readLine();\n            if (line == null) return null;\n            st = new StringTokenizer(line);\n        }\n        return st.nextToken();\n    }\n\n    static int ni() throws IOException { return Integer.parseInt(next()); }\n    static long nl() throws IOException { return Long.parseLong(next()); }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        int n = ni();\n        int[][] f = new int[n][2];\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) { f[i][0] = ni(); f[i][1] = ni(); }\n        Arrays.sort(f, (x, y) -> Integer.compare(x[1], y[1]));\n        int cnt = 0, lastEnd = 0;\n        for (int[] it : f) {\n            if (it[0] >= lastEnd) {\n                cnt++;\n                lastEnd = it[1];\n            }\n        }\n        System.out.println(cnt);\n    }\n}","complexity":"Vaqt O(n log n), xotira O(n)."},{"id":"p05","lesson":"l03","title":"Restaurant Customers","diff":"Oson","ref":"CSES 1619","tags":["sweep line","hodisalar"],"check":"exact","statement":"n ta mijozning kelish va ketish vaqtlari berilgan (barcha vaqtlar har xil). Restoranda bir vaqtda eng ko'p nechta mijoz bo'lgan?","io":"n (1 ≤ n ≤ 2·10^5), keyin n qatorda `a b` (1 ≤ a < b ≤ 10^9). Maksimal mijozlar soni.","examples":[{"input":"3\n5 8\n2 4\n3 9","output":"2"}],"hints":["Har mijozni ikki hodisaga ajrating: kelish va ketish.","Hodisalarni vaqt bo'yicha saralang.","Kelishda +1, ketishda -1; hisoblagich maksimumi — javob."],"idea":"Hodisani bitta `long`ga kodlaymiz: `vaqt * 2 + tur` (1 — kelish, 0 — ketish) va saralaymiz.","proof":"Hisoblagich har vaqt momentida aynan restorandagi mijozlar sonini ko'rsatadi — bu greedy emas, sof hisoblash. Greedy qismi — \"faqat hodisa nuqtalarini tekshirish yetarli\": maksimum doim qandaydir kelish momentida erishiladi.","java":"import java.util.*;\nimport java.io.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n    static StringTokenizer st;\n\n    static String next() throws IOException {\n        while (st == null || !st.hasMoreTokens()) {\n            String line = br.readLine();\n            if (line == null) return null;\n            st = new StringTokenizer(line);\n        }\n        return st.nextToken();\n    }\n\n    static int ni() throws IOException { return Integer.parseInt(next()); }\n    static long nl() throws IOException { return Long.parseLong(next()); }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        int n = ni();\n        long[] ev = new long[2 * n];\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n            long a = nl(), b = nl();\n            ev[2 * i] = a * 2 + 1;\n            ev[2 * i + 1] = b * 2;\n        }\n        Arrays.sort(ev);\n        int cur = 0, best = 0;\n        for (long x : ev) {\n            cur += (x & 1) == 1 ? 1 : -1;\n            best = Math.max(best, cur);\n        }\n        System.out.println(best);\n    }\n}","complexity":"Vaqt O(n log n), xotira O(n)."},{"id":"p06","lesson":"l03","title":"Minimum Arrows to Burst Balloons","diff":"O'rta","ref":"LeetCode 452","tags":["intervallar","overflow"],"check":"exact","statement":"n ta shar gorizontal kesmalar `[x1, x2]` ko'rinishida. x nuqtaga vertikal otilgan o'q `x1 ≤ x ≤ x2` bo'lgan barcha sharlarni yoradi. Barcha sharlarni yorish uchun minimal o'qlar soni?","io":"n (1 ≤ n ≤ 10^5), keyin n qatorda `x1 x2` (-2^31 ≤ x1 ≤ x2 ≤ 2^31 - 1). Minimal o'qlar.","examples":[{"input":"4\n10 16\n2 8\n1 6\n7 12","output":"2"},{"input":"4\n1 2\n3 4\n5 6\n7 8","output":"4"},{"input":"4\n1 2\n2 3\n3 4\n4 5","output":"2"}],"hints":["O'qni qayerga otish eng foydali: sharning boshiga yoki oxiriga?","Tugash bo'yicha saralang.","Comparator'da `a - b` yozsangiz, chegaraviy qiymatlarda xato bo'ladi."],"idea":"Tugash bo'yicha saralab, o'qni joriy sharning oxiriga otamiz; keyingi sharlar shu nuqtagacha boshlansa — ular ham yoriladi.","proof":"Eng erta tugaydigan sharni yorish uchun o'q uning ichida bo'lishi shart. Uning oxiri — bu oraliqdagi eng o'ng nuqta, u boshqa sharlarni ham imkon qadar ko'p qamraydi (exchange: o'qni chaproqqa otgan yechimni oxiriga surish hech qaysi sharni yo'qotmaydi).","java":"import java.util.*;\nimport java.io.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n    static StringTokenizer st;\n\n    static String next() throws IOException {\n        while (st == null || !st.hasMoreTokens()) {\n            String line = br.readLine();\n            if (line == null) return null;\n            st = new StringTokenizer(line);\n        }\n        return st.nextToken();\n    }\n\n    static int ni() throws IOException { return Integer.parseInt(next()); }\n    static long nl() throws IOException { return Long.parseLong(next()); }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        int n = ni();\n        long[][] b = new long[n][2];\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) { b[i][0] = nl(); b[i][1] = nl(); }\n        Arrays.sort(b, (x, y) -> Long.compare(x[1], y[1]));\n        int arrows = 0;\n        long pos = Long.MIN_VALUE;\n        for (long[] it : b) {\n            if (it[0] > pos) {\n                arrows++;\n                pos = it[1];\n            }\n        }\n        System.out.println(arrows);\n    }\n}","complexity":"Vaqt O(n log n), xotira O(n)."},{"id":"p07","lesson":"l04","title":"Tasks and Deadlines","diff":"Oson","ref":"CSES 1630","tags":["saralash","exchange argument"],"check":"exact","statement":"n ta ish, har birining davomiyligi `a` va deadline'i `d`. Ishlarni ketma-ket bajarasiz, 0 vaqtdan boshlab. Ish f vaqtda tugasa, mukofot `d - f` (manfiy bo'lishi mumkin). Maksimal umumiy mukofot?","io":"n (1 ≤ n ≤ 2·10^5), keyin n qatorda `a d` (1 ≤ a, d ≤ 10^6). Maksimal mukofot.","examples":[{"input":"3\n6 10\n8 15\n5 12","output":"2"}],"hints":["Umumiy mukofot `Σd - Σf`. Birinchi qism tartibga bog'liqmi?","Demak `Σf` ni minimallashtirish kerak.","Qo'shni ikki ishni almashtirsangiz `Σf` qanday o'zgaradi?"],"idea":"Davomiylik bo'yicha saralash (Shortest Processing Time). Deadline'lar tartibga ta'sir qilmaydi.","proof":"Qo'shni `x`, `y` da `a[x] > a[y]` bo'lsa, almashtirish `Σf` ni `a[x] - a[y]` ga kamaytiradi. Demak optimal tartibda bunday inversiya yo'q — u davomiylik bo'yicha saralangan.","java":"import java.util.*;\nimport java.io.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n    static StringTokenizer st;\n\n    static String next() throws IOException {\n        while (st == null || !st.hasMoreTokens()) {\n            String line = br.readLine();\n            if (line == null) return null;\n            st = new StringTokenizer(line);\n        }\n        return st.nextToken();\n    }\n\n    static int ni() throws IOException { return Integer.parseInt(next()); }\n    static long nl() throws IOException { return Long.parseLong(next()); }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        int n = ni();\n        int[][] t = new int[n][2];\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) { t[i][0] = ni(); t[i][1] = ni(); }\n        Arrays.sort(t, (x, y) -> Integer.compare(x[0], y[0]));\n        long time = 0, reward = 0;\n        for (int[] it : t) {\n            time += it[0];\n            reward += it[1] - time;\n        }\n        System.out.println(reward);\n    }\n}","complexity":"Vaqt O(n log n), xotira O(n)."},{"id":"p08","lesson":"l04","title":"Largest Number","diff":"O'rta","ref":"LeetCode 179","tags":["comparator","satr"],"check":"exact","statement":"n ta manfiy bo'lmagan butun son berilgan. Ularni shunday tartibda yonma-yon yozingki, hosil bo'lgan son eng katta bo'lsin. Natijani satr sifatida chiqaring (boshida ortiqcha nollar bo'lmasin).","io":"n (1 ≤ n ≤ 100), keyin n ta son (0 ≤ x ≤ 10^9). Eng katta son.","examples":[{"input":"2\n10 2","output":"210"},{"input":"5\n3 30 34 5 9","output":"9534330"},{"input":"2\n0 0","output":"0"}],"hints":["Oddiy satr saralash \"30\" ni \"3\" dan oldin qo'yadi — xato.","a ni b dan oldin qo'yish qachon yaxshi? Ikkala birlashmani solishtiring.","Hamma son 0 bo'lsa nima chiqadi?"],"idea":"Comparator: `(b + a).compareTo(a + b)` — `a + b` kattaroq bo'lsa, `a` oldin.","proof":"Qo'shni juftlik usuli: `a`, `b` qo'shni bo'lsa va `b + a > a + b`, ularni almashtirish butun sonni kattalashtiradi (qolgan qismlar joyida qoladi). Bu munosabat tranzitiv (satrni `a·10^|b| + b` son sifatida yozib ko'rsatiladi), demak saralash to'g'ri tartibni beradi.","java":"import java.util.*;\nimport java.io.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n    static StringTokenizer st;\n\n    static String next() throws IOException {\n        while (st == null || !st.hasMoreTokens()) {\n            String line = br.readLine();\n            if (line == null) return null;\n            st = new StringTokenizer(line);\n        }\n        return st.nextToken();\n    }\n\n    static int ni() throws IOException { return Integer.parseInt(next()); }\n    static long nl() throws IOException { return Long.parseLong(next()); }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        int n = ni();\n        String[] s = new String[n];\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) s[i] = next();\n        Arrays.sort(s, (x, y) -> (y + x).compareTo(x + y));\n        if (s[0].equals(\"0\")) System.out.println(\"0\");\n        else System.out.println(String.join(\"\", s));\n    }\n}","complexity":"Vaqt O(n log n · L), L — sonlar uzunligi."},{"id":"p09","lesson":"l04","title":"Fractional Knapsack","diff":"Oson","ref":"Klassik","tags":["nisbat","saralash"],"check":"float","statement":"n ta buyum, i-sining og'irligi `w[i]`, qiymati `v[i]`. Sumka sig'imi W. Buyumni **bo'lib** olish mumkin (bir qismini olsangiz, qiymati ham proporsional). Maksimal qiymat?","io":"n W (1 ≤ n ≤ 10^5, 1 ≤ W ≤ 10^9), keyin n qatorda `w v` (1 ≤ w, v ≤ 10^6). Javob 6 xona aniqlikda.","examples":[{"input":"3 50\n10 60\n20 100\n30 120","output":"240.000000"},{"input":"1 10\n20 100","output":"50.000000"}],"hints":["Bir birlik og'irlik eng qimmat bo'lgan buyum qaysi?","Nisbatlarni kasrsiz solishtiring: `v1·w2` va `v2·w1`.","Oxirgi buyum qisman olinadi."],"idea":"`v/w` bo'yicha kamayish tartibida saralab, sig'im tugaguncha olamiz.","proof":"Optimal yechimda nisbati kichikroq buyumdan biror qism olingan, nisbati kattaroq buyum esa to'liq olinmagan bo'lsa — o'sha og'irlikni almashtirish qiymatni oshiradi. Demak optimal yechim — greedy.","java":"import java.util.*;\nimport java.io.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n    static StringTokenizer st;\n\n    static String next() throws IOException {\n        while (st == null || !st.hasMoreTokens()) {\n            String line = br.readLine();\n            if (line == null) return null;\n            st = new StringTokenizer(line);\n        }\n        return st.nextToken();\n    }\n\n    static int ni() throws IOException { return Integer.parseInt(next()); }\n    static long nl() throws IOException { return Long.parseLong(next()); }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        int n = ni();\n        long W = nl();\n        long[][] it = new long[n][2];\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) { it[i][0] = nl(); it[i][1] = nl(); }\n        Arrays.sort(it, (x, y) -> Long.compare(y[1] * x[0], x[1] * y[0]));\n        double total = 0;\n        long cap = W;\n        for (long[] b : it) {\n            if (cap == 0) break;\n            long take = Math.min(cap, b[0]);\n            total += (double) b[1] * take / b[0];\n            cap -= take;\n        }\n        System.out.println(String.format(Locale.US, \"%.6f\", total));\n    }\n}","complexity":"Vaqt O(n log n), xotira O(n)."},{"id":"p10","lesson":"l05","title":"Course Schedule III","diff":"Qiyin","ref":"LeetCode 630","tags":["deadline","max-heap","regret"],"check":"exact","statement":"n ta kurs: i-kurs `t[i]` kun davom etadi va `d[i]`-kungacha (shu kun ham kiradi) tugashi kerak. 1-kundan boshlab kurslarni ketma-ket o'tasiz. Maksimal nechta kursni o'tish mumkin?","io":"n (1 ≤ n ≤ 10^4), keyin n qatorda `t d` (1 ≤ t, d ≤ 10^4). Javob.","examples":[{"input":"4\n100 200\n200 1300\n1000 1250\n2000 3200","output":"3"},{"input":"1\n1 2","output":"1"},{"input":"2\n3 2\n4 3","output":"0"}],"hints":["Qaysi tartibda o'tish kerak, agar to'plam tanlangan bo'lsa? (EDD)","Deadline bo'yicha yurib, kursni \"qabul qiling\".","Vaqt oshib ketsa — qabul qilinganlardan qaysi birini chiqarish eng foydali?"],"idea":"Moore–Hodgson: deadline bo'yicha saralab, davomiyliklarni max-heap'da saqlaymiz; umumiy vaqt deadline'dan oshsa — eng uzunini chiqaramiz.","proof":"Tanlangan to'plam uchun EDD tartibi optimal (exchange). Har qadamdan keyin heap — shu deadline'gacha mumkin bo'lgan eng ko'p kurs va ular orasida umumiy vaqti eng kichigi. Eng uzunini chiqarish sonni saqlaydi va vaqtni maksimal qisqartiradi.","java":"import java.util.*;\nimport java.io.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n    static StringTokenizer st;\n\n    static String next() throws IOException {\n        while (st == null || !st.hasMoreTokens()) {\n            String line = br.readLine();\n            if (line == null) return null;\n            st = new StringTokenizer(line);\n        }\n        return st.nextToken();\n    }\n\n    static int ni() throws IOException { return Integer.parseInt(next()); }\n    static long nl() throws IOException { return Long.parseLong(next()); }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        int n = ni();\n        int[][] c = new int[n][2];\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) { c[i][0] = ni(); c[i][1] = ni(); }\n        Arrays.sort(c, (x, y) -> Integer.compare(x[1], y[1]));\n        PriorityQueue<Integer> pq = new PriorityQueue<>(Collections.reverseOrder());\n        long time = 0;\n        for (int[] it : c) {\n            pq.add(it[0]);\n            time += it[0];\n            if (time > it[1]) time -= pq.poll();\n        }\n        System.out.println(pq.size());\n    }\n}","complexity":"Vaqt O(n log n), xotira O(n)."},{"id":"p11","lesson":"l05","title":"Job Sequencing with Deadlines","diff":"O'rta","ref":"Klassik","tags":["deadline","min-heap"],"check":"exact","statement":"n ta ish, har biri 1 birlik vaqt oladi. i-ishning deadline'i `d[i]` (shu vaqtgacha tugashi kerak, vaqt 1 dan boshlanadi) va foydasi `p[i]`. Bir vaqtda bitta ish. Bajariladigan ishlar soni va maksimal umumiy foydani chiqaring.","io":"n (1 ≤ n ≤ 10^5), keyin n qatorda `d p` (1 ≤ d ≤ n, 1 ≤ p ≤ 10^9). Ikki son: ishlar soni va foyda.","examples":[{"input":"4\n4 20\n1 10\n1 40\n1 30","output":"2 60"},{"input":"5\n2 100\n1 19\n2 27\n1 25\n1 15","output":"2 127"}],"hints":["Deadline'i d bo'lgan ishlar orasidan ko'pi bilan d tasi d-vaqtgacha bajarilishi mumkin.","Deadline bo'yicha yuring va qabul qilingan foydalarni heap'da saqlang.","Heap o'lchami joriy deadline'dan oshsa — eng arzonini chiqaring."],"idea":"Min-heap'dagi to'plam — har doim deadline'larga sig'adigan eng foydali to'plam.","proof":"Bu scheduling matroid: \"deadline'larga sig'adigan ishlar to'plami\" matroid tashkil qiladi, va matroidda greedy optimal. Heap usuli — shu greedy'ning deadline tartibida bajarilishi.","java":"import java.util.*;\nimport java.io.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n    static StringTokenizer st;\n\n    static String next() throws IOException {\n        while (st == null || !st.hasMoreTokens()) {\n            String line = br.readLine();\n            if (line == null) return null;\n            st = new StringTokenizer(line);\n        }\n        return st.nextToken();\n    }\n\n    static int ni() throws IOException { return Integer.parseInt(next()); }\n    static long nl() throws IOException { return Long.parseLong(next()); }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        int n = ni();\n        int[][] job = new int[n][2];\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) { job[i][0] = ni(); job[i][1] = ni(); }\n        Arrays.sort(job, (x, y) -> Integer.compare(x[0], y[0]));\n        PriorityQueue<Long> pq = new PriorityQueue<>();\n        long sum = 0;\n        for (int[] j : job) {\n            pq.add((long) j[1]);\n            sum += j[1];\n            if (pq.size() > j[0]) sum -= pq.poll();\n        }\n        System.out.println(pq.size() + \" \" + sum);\n    }\n}","complexity":"Vaqt O(n log n), xotira O(n)."},{"id":"p12","lesson":"l06","title":"Connect Ropes (Huffman)","diff":"Oson","ref":"Klassik","tags":["PriorityQueue","Huffman"],"check":"exact","statement":"n ta arqon, uzunliklari `a[i]`. Ikki arqonni ulash narxi — ularning uzunliklari yig'indisi (natija ham shu uzunlikdagi arqon). Hammasini bitta arqonga ulashning minimal narxi?","io":"n (1 ≤ n ≤ 2·10^5), keyin `a` (1 ≤ a ≤ 10^9). Minimal narx.","examples":[{"input":"4\n4 3 2 6","output":"29"},{"input":"5\n1 2 3 4 5","output":"33"},{"input":"1\n5","output":"0"}],"hints":["Har arqon uzunligi narxga necha marta qo'shiladi?","Erta ulangan arqonlar ko'p marta qayta \"to'lanadi\".","Har doim ikki eng qisqasini ulang."],"idea":"Min-heap'dan ikki kichigini olib, yig'indisini qaytarib qo'yamiz.","proof":"Ulanishlar ikkilik daraxt hosil qiladi; har barg o'z chuqurligicha marta to'lanadi. Optimal daraxtda eng chuqur ikki barg aka-uka va ularga eng kichik ikki uzunlikni berish narxni oshirmaydi (exchange) — bu Huffman teoremasi.","java":"import java.util.*;\nimport java.io.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n    static StringTokenizer st;\n\n    static String next() throws IOException {\n        while (st == null || !st.hasMoreTokens()) {\n            String line = br.readLine();\n            if (line == null) return null;\n            st = new StringTokenizer(line);\n        }\n        return st.nextToken();\n    }\n\n    static int ni() throws IOException { return Integer.parseInt(next()); }\n    static long nl() throws IOException { return Long.parseLong(next()); }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        int n = ni();\n        PriorityQueue<Long> pq = new PriorityQueue<>();\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) pq.add(nl());\n        long cost = 0;\n        while (pq.size() > 1) {\n            long s = pq.poll() + pq.poll();\n            cost += s;\n            pq.add(s);\n        }\n        System.out.println(cost);\n    }\n}","complexity":"Vaqt O(n log n), xotira O(n)."},{"id":"p13","lesson":"l06","title":"IPO","diff":"Qiyin","ref":"LeetCode 502","tags":["PriorityQueue","ikki to'plam"],"check":"exact","statement":"Boshlang'ich kapital w. n ta loyiha: i-sini boshlash uchun kapital kamida `c[i]` bo'lishi kerak va u `p[i]` sof foyda beradi (kapitalga qo'shiladi, `c[i]` sarflanmaydi). Ko'pi bilan k ta loyiha. Yakuniy maksimal kapital?","io":"Birinchi qatorda `n k w` (1 ≤ n, k ≤ 10^5, 0 ≤ w ≤ 10^9), ikkinchisida `p[1..n]`, uchinchisida `c[1..n]` (0 ≤ p, c ≤ 10^9). Yakuniy kapital.","examples":[{"input":"3 2 0\n1 2 3\n0 1 1","output":"4"},{"input":"3 3 0\n1 2 3\n0 1 2","output":"6"}],"hints":["Hozir qaysi loyihalarni boshlay olasiz?","Ular orasidan qaysi birini tanlash hech qachon xato emas?","Kapital faqat o'sadi — ochilgan loyihalar ochiq qoladi."],"idea":"Kapital bo'yicha saralangan loyihalarni ko'rsatkich bilan max-heap'ga \"ochamiz\", har qadamda heap'dagi eng foydalini olamiz.","proof":"Har qadamda eng katta foydani olish keyingi qadamlarda ochiladigan loyihalar to'plamini maksimal kengaytiradi; foyda manfiy emas, demak boshqa tanlov hech qachon ko'proq kapital bermaydi (greedy stays ahead).","java":"import java.util.*;\nimport java.io.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n    static StringTokenizer st;\n\n    static String next() throws IOException {\n        while (st == null || !st.hasMoreTokens()) {\n            String line = br.readLine();\n            if (line == null) return null;\n            st = new StringTokenizer(line);\n        }\n        return st.nextToken();\n    }\n\n    static int ni() throws IOException { return Integer.parseInt(next()); }\n    static long nl() throws IOException { return Long.parseLong(next()); }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        int n = ni(), k = ni();\n        long w = nl();\n        long[] p = new long[n], c = new long[n];\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) p[i] = nl();\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) c[i] = nl();\n        Integer[] idx = new Integer[n];\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) idx[i] = i;\n        Arrays.sort(idx, (x, y) -> Long.compare(c[x], c[y]));\n        PriorityQueue<Long> pq = new PriorityQueue<>(Collections.reverseOrder());\n        int ptr = 0;\n        for (int step = 0; step < k; step++) {\n            while (ptr < n && c[idx[ptr]] <= w) pq.add(p[idx[ptr++]]);\n            if (pq.isEmpty()) break;\n            w += pq.poll();\n        }\n        System.out.println(w);\n    }\n}","complexity":"Vaqt O(n log n), xotira O(n)."},{"id":"p14","lesson":"l07","title":"Minimum Refueling Stops","diff":"Qiyin","ref":"LeetCode 871","tags":["regret","max-heap"],"check":"exact","statement":"Mashina 0 nuqtadan target nuqtaga boradi. Boshida `start` litr yoqilg'i bor, 1 birlik masofa 1 litr. Yo'lda n ta stansiya: `pos` nuqtada `fuel` litr (to'xtasangiz hammasini olasiz; bak cheksiz). Minimal to'xtashlar soni? Yetib bo'lmasa -1.","io":"`target start n` (1 ≤ target, start ≤ 10^9, 0 ≤ n ≤ 10^5), keyin n qatorda `pos fuel` (pos o'sish tartibida, 0 < pos < target). Javob.","examples":[{"input":"1 1 0","output":"0"},{"input":"100 1 1\n10 100","output":"-1"},{"input":"100 10 4\n10 60\n20 30\n30 30\n60 40","output":"2"}],"hints":["Qaysi stansiyada to'xtashni darhol hal qilish shart emas.","O'tib ketgan stansiyalarni \"zaxira\" sifatida saqlang.","Yoqilg'i yetmay qolsa — zaxiradagi eng kattasidan foydalaning."],"idea":"Regret greedy: yetiladigan stansiyalarni max-heap'ga solamiz; keyingi nuqtaga yetolmasak — heap'dan eng katta yoqilg'ini olib, \"o'sha yerda to'xtagan edim\" deymiz.","proof":"k ta to'xtash bilan eng uzoqqa yetish uchun yetiladigan stansiyalardan eng katta k tasini tanlash kerak (exchange). Algoritm har to'xtashda aynan shuni qiladi, demak minimal k bilan target'ga yetadi.","java":"import java.util.*;\nimport java.io.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n    static StringTokenizer st;\n\n    static String next() throws IOException {\n        while (st == null || !st.hasMoreTokens()) {\n            String line = br.readLine();\n            if (line == null) return null;\n            st = new StringTokenizer(line);\n        }\n        return st.nextToken();\n    }\n\n    static int ni() throws IOException { return Integer.parseInt(next()); }\n    static long nl() throws IOException { return Long.parseLong(next()); }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        long target = nl(), start = nl();\n        int n = ni();\n        long[][] st = new long[n][2];\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) { st[i][0] = nl(); st[i][1] = nl(); }\n        PriorityQueue<Long> pq = new PriorityQueue<>(Collections.reverseOrder());\n        long reach = start;\n        int stops = 0, i = 0;\n        while (reach < target) {\n            while (i < n && st[i][0] <= reach) pq.add(st[i++][1]);\n            if (pq.isEmpty()) { stops = -1; break; }\n            reach += pq.poll();\n            stops++;\n        }\n        System.out.println(stops);\n    }\n}","complexity":"Vaqt O(n log n), xotira O(n)."},{"id":"p15","lesson":"l07","title":"Buy Low Sell High","diff":"Qiyin","ref":"Codeforces 865D","tags":["regret","min-heap"],"check":"exact","statement":"n kun davomida bitta aksiya narxini bilasiz: `p[i]`. Har kuni bitta aksiya sotib olish, bitta sotish yoki hech narsa qilmaslik mumkin. Boshida aksiya yo'q va oxirida ham qolmasligi kerak. Maksimal foyda?","io":"n (2 ≤ n ≤ 3·10^5), keyin `p` (1 ≤ p ≤ 10^6). Maksimal foyda.","examples":[{"input":"9\n10 5 4 7 9 12 6 2 10","output":"20"},{"input":"20\n3 1 4 1 5 9 2 6 5 3 5 8 9 7 9 3 2 3 8 4","output":"41"}],"hints":["Bugungi narxda sotish foydali bo'lsa — darhol soting, lekin keyinroq afsuslanish imkonini saqlang.","Oldin `x` da olib `p` da sotgan bo'lsangiz, keyin `q` narx kelsa, `q - p` qo'shish `x` da olib `q` da sotishga teng.","Har kun narxni heap'ga qo'shing; sotgan kuningizda — ikki marta."],"idea":"Min-heap. `top < p` bo'lsa: `ans += p - top`, `top` ni chiqarib, `p` ni qo'shamiz. Har holda `p` ni yana bir marta qo'shamiz.","proof":"Ikki nusxa ikki xil kelajakni saqlaydi: biri \"bu sotuvni keyinroq qimmatroq narxga ko'chirish\" (afsus), ikkinchisi \"bugun sotib olish\". Har bir heap amali mumkin bo'lgan tranzaksiyalar to'plamini ifodalaydi, va har kuni eng arzon variant bilan juftlash foydani maksimal oshiradi. To'liq isbot — min-cost flow orqali.","java":"import java.util.*;\nimport java.io.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n    static StringTokenizer st;\n\n    static String next() throws IOException {\n        while (st == null || !st.hasMoreTokens()) {\n            String line = br.readLine();\n            if (line == null) return null;\n            st = new StringTokenizer(line);\n        }\n        return st.nextToken();\n    }\n\n    static int ni() throws IOException { return Integer.parseInt(next()); }\n    static long nl() throws IOException { return Long.parseLong(next()); }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        int n = ni();\n        PriorityQueue<Long> pq = new PriorityQueue<>();\n        long ans = 0;\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n            long p = nl();\n            if (!pq.isEmpty() && pq.peek() < p) {\n                ans += p - pq.poll();\n                pq.add(p);\n            }\n            pq.add(p);\n        }\n        System.out.println(ans);\n    }\n}","complexity":"Vaqt O(n log n), xotira O(n)."},{"id":"p16","lesson":"l08","title":"Ferris Wheel","diff":"Oson","ref":"CSES 1090","tags":["ikki ko'rsatkich","saralash"],"check":"exact","statement":"n ta bola, og'irliklari `p[i]`. Har kabinaga 1 yoki 2 bola o'tiradi, umumiy og'irlik ≤ x. Minimal kabinalar soni?","io":"n x (1 ≤ n ≤ 2·10^5, 1 ≤ x ≤ 10^9), keyin `p` (1 ≤ p ≤ x). Javob.","examples":[{"input":"4 10\n7 2 3 9","output":"3"}],"hints":["Eng og'ir bola kim bilan o'tirishi mumkin?","Agar u eng yengil bilan ham sig'masa — u yolg'iz.","Ikki ko'rsatkich: chapda eng yengil, o'ngda eng og'ir."],"idea":"Saralab, `p[i] + p[j] ≤ x` bo'lsa ikkalasini, aks holda faqat og'irini o'tqazamiz.","proof":"Exchange: optimal yechimda eng og'ir `H` ning sherigini eng yengil `L` ga almashtirish kabinalar sonini oshirmaydi, chunki `L` ning eski sherigi `z` uchun `y + z ≤ y + H ≤ x`.","java":"import java.util.*;\nimport java.io.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n    static StringTokenizer st;\n\n    static String next() throws IOException {\n        while (st == null || !st.hasMoreTokens()) {\n            String line = br.readLine();\n            if (line == null) return null;\n            st = new StringTokenizer(line);\n        }\n        return st.nextToken();\n    }\n\n    static int ni() throws IOException { return Integer.parseInt(next()); }\n    static long nl() throws IOException { return Long.parseLong(next()); }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        int n = ni();\n        long x = nl();\n        long[] p = new long[n];\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) p[i] = nl();\n        Arrays.sort(p);\n        int i = 0, j = n - 1, gond = 0;\n        while (i <= j) {\n            if (i < j && p[i] + p[j] <= x) i++;\n            j--;\n            gond++;\n        }\n        System.out.println(gond);\n    }\n}","complexity":"Vaqt O(n log n), xotira O(n)."},{"id":"p17","lesson":"l08","title":"Apartments","diff":"Oson","ref":"CSES 1084","tags":["ikki ko'rsatkich","juftlash"],"check":"exact","statement":"n ta xaridor, i-si `a[i]` o'lchamli kvartira xohlaydi va `|a[i] - b| ≤ k` bo'lsa rozi. m ta kvartira, o'lchamlari `b[j]`. Har kvartiraga ko'pi bilan bitta xaridor. Maksimal nechta xaridor kvartira oladi?","io":"n m k (1 ≤ n, m ≤ 2·10^5, 0 ≤ k ≤ 10^9), keyin `a`, keyin `b` (1 ≤ qiymat ≤ 10^9). Javob.","examples":[{"input":"4 3 5\n60 45 80 60\n30 60 75","output":"2"}],"hints":["Ikkala ro'yxatni saralang.","Eng kichik kvartira eng kichik xaridorga juda kichik bo'lsa, u hech kimga yaramaydi.","Eng kichik xaridorga eng kichik kvartira juda katta bo'lsa — u xaridorga hech narsa yaramaydi."],"idea":"Ikki ko'rsatkich: mos kelsa juftlaymiz, kvartira juda kichik — kvartirani o'tkazamiz, aks holda xaridorni.","proof":"Saralangan holatda eng kichik xaridor va eng kichik mos kvartirani juftlash \"kesishmaydigan\" juftlashga olib keladi; har qanday optimal juftlashdagi kesishgan juftlarni almashtirib, shu ko'rinishga keltirish mumkin.","java":"import java.util.*;\nimport java.io.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n    static StringTokenizer st;\n\n    static String next() throws IOException {\n        while (st == null || !st.hasMoreTokens()) {\n            String line = br.readLine();\n            if (line == null) return null;\n            st = new StringTokenizer(line);\n        }\n        return st.nextToken();\n    }\n\n    static int ni() throws IOException { return Integer.parseInt(next()); }\n    static long nl() throws IOException { return Long.parseLong(next()); }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        int n = ni(), m = ni();\n        long k = nl();\n        long[] a = new long[n], b = new long[m];\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) a[i] = nl();\n        for (int j = 0; j < m; j++) b[j] = nl();\n        Arrays.sort(a);\n        Arrays.sort(b);\n        int i = 0, j = 0, cnt = 0;\n        while (i < n && j < m) {\n            if (Math.abs(a[i] - b[j]) <= k) { cnt++; i++; j++; }\n            else if (b[j] < a[i] - k) j++;\n            else i++;\n        }\n        System.out.println(cnt);\n    }\n}","complexity":"Vaqt O(n log n + m log m), xotira O(n + m)."},{"id":"p18","lesson":"l08","title":"Concert Tickets","diff":"O'rta","ref":"CSES 1091","tags":["TreeMap","multiset"],"check":"exact","statement":"n ta chipta, narxlari `h[i]`. m ta xaridor ketma-ket keladi; i-xaridor `t[i]` dan oshmaydigan **eng qimmat** chiptani oladi. Har xaridor uchun chipta narxini yoki -1 ni chiqaring.","io":"n m (1 ≤ n, m ≤ 2·10^5), keyin `h`, keyin `t` (1 ≤ qiymat ≤ 10^9). m qatorda javoblar.","examples":[{"input":"5 3\n5 3 7 8 5\n4 8 3","output":"3\n8\n-1"}],"hints":["\"≤ t bo'lgan eng katta\" — qaysi TreeMap metodi?","Bir xil narxli chiptalar bo'lishi mumkin — sonini saqlang.","Chiptani sotgach, multiset'dan bitta nusxani o'chiring."],"idea":"`TreeMap<Integer, Integer>` multiset sifatida, `floorKey(t)`.","proof":"Greedy qoida shartda berilgan; vazifa — har so'rovni O(log n) da bajarish. Balanslangan daraxt (TreeMap) floor va o'chirishni shunday bajaradi.","java":"import java.util.*;\nimport java.io.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n    static StringTokenizer st;\n\n    static String next() throws IOException {\n        while (st == null || !st.hasMoreTokens()) {\n            String line = br.readLine();\n            if (line == null) return null;\n            st = new StringTokenizer(line);\n        }\n        return st.nextToken();\n    }\n\n    static int ni() throws IOException { return Integer.parseInt(next()); }\n    static long nl() throws IOException { return Long.parseLong(next()); }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        int n = ni(), m = ni();\n        TreeMap<Integer, Integer> ms = new TreeMap<>();\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) ms.merge(ni(), 1, Integer::sum);\n        StringBuilder out = new StringBuilder();\n        for (int i = 0; i < m; i++) {\n            Integer p = ms.floorKey(ni());\n            if (p == null) out.append(-1).append('\\n');\n            else {\n                out.append(p).append('\\n');\n                if (ms.merge(p, -1, Integer::sum) == 0) ms.remove(p);\n            }\n        }\n        System.out.print(out);\n    }\n}","complexity":"Vaqt O((n + m) log n), xotira O(n)."},{"id":"p19","lesson":"l09","title":"Jump Game II","diff":"O'rta","ref":"LeetCode 45","tags":["qamrov","BFS qatlamlari"],"check":"exact","statement":"`a[i]` — i-pozitsiyadan ko'pi bilan nechta qadam oldinga sakrash mumkin. 0-pozitsiyadan oxirgisiga yetish uchun minimal sakrashlar soni? Yetish har doim mumkin.","io":"n (1 ≤ n ≤ 10^5), keyin `a` (0 ≤ a ≤ 1000). Minimal sakrashlar.","examples":[{"input":"5\n2 3 1 1 4","output":"2"},{"input":"5\n2 3 0 1 4","output":"2"}],"hints":["Bitta sakrashda yetiladigan indekslar ketma-ket oraliq hosil qiladimi?","Ikki sakrashda-chi?","`curEnd` — joriy qatlam oxiri, `far` — keyingi qatlam oxiri."],"idea":"BFS qatlamlarini navbatsiz yuritamiz: `i == curEnd` bo'lganda sakrash sonini oshirib, `curEnd = far`.","proof":"k sakrashda yetiladigan indekslar — `[0, R_k]` oraliq, va `R_{k+1}` — shu oraliqdan bir sakrashdagi eng uzoq nuqta. Algoritm aynan shu `R_k` larni hisoblaydi, demak birinchi `R_k ≥ n - 1` bo'lgan k — minimal.","java":"import java.util.*;\nimport java.io.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n    static StringTokenizer st;\n\n    static String next() throws IOException {\n        while (st == null || !st.hasMoreTokens()) {\n            String line = br.readLine();\n            if (line == null) return null;\n            st = new StringTokenizer(line);\n        }\n        return st.nextToken();\n    }\n\n    static int ni() throws IOException { return Integer.parseInt(next()); }\n    static long nl() throws IOException { return Long.parseLong(next()); }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        int n = ni();\n        int[] a = new int[n];\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) a[i] = ni();\n        int jumps = 0, curEnd = 0, far = 0;\n        for (int i = 0; i < n - 1; i++) {\n            far = Math.max(far, i + a[i]);\n            if (i == curEnd) {\n                jumps++;\n                curEnd = far;\n            }\n        }\n        System.out.println(jumps);\n    }\n}","complexity":"Vaqt O(n), xotira O(n)."},{"id":"p20","lesson":"l09","title":"Gas Station","diff":"O'rta","ref":"LeetCode 134","tags":["aylana","prefiks"],"check":"exact","statement":"Aylana yo'lda n ta stansiya. i-stansiyada `gas[i]` litr yoqilg'i olasiz, i dan i+1 ga borish `cost[i]` litr talab qiladi. Bo'sh bak bilan qaysi stansiyadan boshlasangiz, aylanani to'liq aylanib chiqasiz? Javob yagona bo'ladi; bo'lmasa -1.","io":"n (1 ≤ n ≤ 10^5), keyin `gas`, keyin `cost` (0 ≤ qiymat ≤ 10^4). Indeks (0 dan) yoki -1.","examples":[{"input":"5\n1 2 3 4 5\n3 4 5 1 2","output":"3"},{"input":"3\n2 3 4\n3 4 3","output":"-1"}],"hints":["Umumiy yoqilg'i umumiy sarfdan kam bo'lsa — javob yo'q.","s dan boshlab i da bak manfiy bo'ldi. s va i oralig'idagi stansiyalardan boshlash yordam beradimi?","Bitta o'tish yetarli."],"idea":"Bak manfiy bo'lsa, boshlanishni `i + 1` ga ko'chirib, bakni 0 qilamiz.","proof":"s dan i gacha har oraliq nuqta j ga bakda `≥ 0` bilan kelgan edik; j dan 0 bilan boshlash yaxshiroq emas, demak ularning hech biri i dan o'tolmaydi. `Σ ≥ 0` bo'lsa, oxirgi boshlanish nuqtasidan aylanma yo'l to'liq o'tiladi.","java":"import java.util.*;\nimport java.io.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n    static StringTokenizer st;\n\n    static String next() throws IOException {\n        while (st == null || !st.hasMoreTokens()) {\n            String line = br.readLine();\n            if (line == null) return null;\n            st = new StringTokenizer(line);\n        }\n        return st.nextToken();\n    }\n\n    static int ni() throws IOException { return Integer.parseInt(next()); }\n    static long nl() throws IOException { return Long.parseLong(next()); }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        int n = ni();\n        long[] gas = new long[n], cost = new long[n];\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) gas[i] = nl();\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) cost[i] = nl();\n        long total = 0, tank = 0;\n        int start = 0;\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n            long d = gas[i] - cost[i];\n            total += d;\n            tank += d;\n            if (tank < 0) { start = i + 1; tank = 0; }\n        }\n        System.out.println(total < 0 ? -1 : start);\n    }\n}","complexity":"Vaqt O(n), xotira O(n)."},{"id":"p21","lesson":"l10","title":"Remove K Digits","diff":"O'rta","ref":"LeetCode 402","tags":["monoton stek","leksikografik"],"check":"exact","statement":"Musbat son satr ko'rinishida berilgan. Undan aynan k ta raqamni o'chirib, eng kichik sonni hosil qiling. Boshidagi nollarni olib tashlang; hech narsa qolmasa — `0`.","io":"Bitta qatorda `num k` (1 ≤ k ≤ |num| ≤ 10^5). Natija.","examples":[{"input":"1432219 3","output":"1219"},{"input":"10200 1","output":"200"},{"input":"10 2","output":"0"}],"hints":["Ikki son solishtirilganda chapdagi raqam muhimroq.","Agar raqamdan keyin undan kichik raqam kelsa, birinchisini o'chirish foydali.","Stek bilan bir o'tishda; oxirida k qolsa — oxiridan kesing."],"idea":"Monoton (kamaymaydigan) stek: `top > c` va `k > 0` bo'lsa, tepani o'chiramiz.","proof":"Birinchi `d[i] > d[i+1]` pozitsiyadagi raqamni o'chirish natijani bitta o'chirish uchun minimal qiladi (chapdagi farqli pozitsiya kichrayadi). Stek bu qoidani k marta ketma-ket, har safar yangi satrda qo'llashni bitta o'tishda bajaradi.","java":"import java.util.*;\nimport java.io.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n    static StringTokenizer st;\n\n    static String next() throws IOException {\n        while (st == null || !st.hasMoreTokens()) {\n            String line = br.readLine();\n            if (line == null) return null;\n            st = new StringTokenizer(line);\n        }\n        return st.nextToken();\n    }\n\n    static int ni() throws IOException { return Integer.parseInt(next()); }\n    static long nl() throws IOException { return Long.parseLong(next()); }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        String num = next();\n        int k = ni();\n        StringBuilder st = new StringBuilder();\n        for (char c : num.toCharArray()) {\n            while (k > 0 && st.length() > 0 && st.charAt(st.length() - 1) > c) {\n                st.deleteCharAt(st.length() - 1);\n                k--;\n            }\n            st.append(c);\n        }\n        st.setLength(st.length() - k);\n        int i = 0;\n        while (i < st.length() - 1 && st.charAt(i) == '0') i++;\n        String res = st.substring(i);\n        System.out.println(res.isEmpty() ? \"0\" : res);\n    }\n}","complexity":"Vaqt O(n), xotira O(n)."},{"id":"p22","lesson":"l10","title":"Smallest Subsequence of Distinct Characters","diff":"Qiyin","ref":"LeetCode 1081","tags":["monoton stek","leksikografik"],"check":"exact","statement":"Kichik lotin harflaridan iborat s satri. s ning shunday subsequence'ini topingki, unda s dagi har bir harf **aynan bir marta** qatnashsin va u leksikografik eng kichik bo'lsin.","io":"Bitta satr s (1 ≤ |s| ≤ 10^5). Natija.","examples":[{"input":"bcabc","output":"abc"},{"input":"cbacdcbc","output":"acdb"}],"hints":["Remove K Digits'ga o'xshaydi: tepadagi kattaroq harfni olib tashlash foydali.","Lekin uni faqat keyinroq yana uchrasa olib tashlash mumkin.","Har harfning oxirgi uchrash indeksini oldindan hisoblang; stekda bor harfni qayta qo'shmang."],"idea":"Monoton stek + `last[]` + `inStack[]`.","proof":"Natijaning birinchi harfi — shunday eng kichik harfki, undan keyin qolgan barcha harflar hali uchraydi. Stek har qadamda aynan shu shartni tekshiradi: tepadagi harf kattaroq va keyin yana uchrasa — uni hozir qoldirish natijani faqat yomonlashtiradi.","java":"import java.util.*;\nimport java.io.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n    static StringTokenizer st;\n\n    static String next() throws IOException {\n        while (st == null || !st.hasMoreTokens()) {\n            String line = br.readLine();\n            if (line == null) return null;\n            st = new StringTokenizer(line);\n        }\n        return st.nextToken();\n    }\n\n    static int ni() throws IOException { return Integer.parseInt(next()); }\n    static long nl() throws IOException { return Long.parseLong(next()); }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        String s = next();\n        int[] last = new int[26];\n        for (int i = 0; i < s.length(); i++) last[s.charAt(i) - 'a'] = i;\n        boolean[] in = new boolean[26];\n        StringBuilder st = new StringBuilder();\n        for (int i = 0; i < s.length(); i++) {\n            char c = s.charAt(i);\n            if (in[c - 'a']) continue;\n            while (st.length() > 0) {\n                char top = st.charAt(st.length() - 1);\n                if (top > c && last[top - 'a'] > i) {\n                    st.deleteCharAt(st.length() - 1);\n                    in[top - 'a'] = false;\n                } else break;\n            }\n            st.append(c);\n            in[c - 'a'] = true;\n        }\n        System.out.println(st);\n    }\n}","complexity":"Vaqt O(n), xotira O(1) (26 harf)."},{"id":"p23","lesson":"l11","title":"Road Reparation","diff":"O'rta","ref":"CSES 1675","tags":["MST","Kruskal","DSU"],"check":"exact","statement":"n ta shahar, m ta yo'l, har yo'lni ta'mirlash narxi c. Barcha shaharlar orasida yo'l bo'lishi uchun ta'mirlashning minimal umumiy narxi? Imkonsiz bo'lsa `IMPOSSIBLE`.","io":"n m (1 ≤ n ≤ 10^5, 1 ≤ m ≤ 2·10^5), keyin m qatorda `a b c` (1 ≤ c ≤ 10^9). Javob.","examples":[{"input":"5 6\n1 2 3\n2 3 5\n2 4 2\n3 4 8\n5 1 7\n5 4 4","output":"14"}],"hints":["Bu minimal spanning tree.","Qirralarni narx bo'yicha saralab, sikl hosil qilmaydiganlarini oling.","Sikl tekshiruvi — DSU. Oxirida n-1 ta qirra olinmagan bo'lsa — graf bog'lanmagan."],"idea":"Kruskal + DSU (path halving, union by size). Narx yig'indisi `long`.","proof":"Cut property: har qadamda olingan qirra ikki komponentni bog'laydigan eng yengil qirra, demak u biror MST'da bor (exchange). Induksiya bilan barcha olingan qirralar bitta MST'ni tashkil qiladi.","java":"import java.util.*;\nimport java.io.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n    static StringTokenizer st;\n\n    static String next() throws IOException {\n        while (st == null || !st.hasMoreTokens()) {\n            String line = br.readLine();\n            if (line == null) return null;\n            st = new StringTokenizer(line);\n        }\n        return st.nextToken();\n    }\n\n    static int ni() throws IOException { return Integer.parseInt(next()); }\n    static long nl() throws IOException { return Long.parseLong(next()); }\n\n    static int[] par, sz;\n\n    static int find(int x) {\n        while (par[x] != x) {\n            par[x] = par[par[x]];\n            x = par[x];\n        }\n        return x;\n    }\n\n    static boolean union(int a, int b) {\n        a = find(a);\n        b = find(b);\n        if (a == b) return false;\n        if (sz[a] < sz[b]) { int t = a; a = b; b = t; }\n        par[b] = a;\n        sz[a] += sz[b];\n        return true;\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        int n = ni(), m = ni();\n        int[][] e = new int[m][3];\n        for (int i = 0; i < m; i++) { e[i][0] = ni() - 1; e[i][1] = ni() - 1; e[i][2] = ni(); }\n        Arrays.sort(e, (x, y) -> Integer.compare(x[2], y[2]));\n        par = new int[n];\n        sz = new int[n];\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) { par[i] = i; sz[i] = 1; }\n        long total = 0;\n        int used = 0;\n        for (int[] ed : e) {\n            if (union(ed[0], ed[1])) {\n                total += ed[2];\n                used++;\n            }\n        }\n        System.out.println(used == n - 1 ? String.valueOf(total) : \"IMPOSSIBLE\");\n    }\n}","complexity":"Vaqt O(m log m), xotira O(n + m)."},{"id":"p24","lesson":"l12","title":"Shortest Routes I","diff":"O'rta","ref":"CSES 1671","tags":["Dijkstra","PriorityQueue"],"check":"exact","statement":"n ta shahar, m ta bir tomonlama reys (narxi c). 1-shahardan barcha shaharlarga eng arzon yo'l narxini toping. Barcha shaharlarga yetish mumkin.","io":"n m (1 ≤ n ≤ 10^5, 1 ≤ m ≤ 2·10^5), keyin m qatorda `a b c` (1 ≤ c ≤ 10^9). n ta son — masofalar.","examples":[{"input":"3 4\n1 2 6\n1 3 2\n3 2 3\n1 3 4","output":"0 5 2"}],"hints":["Og'irliklar musbat — Dijkstra.","Masofalar 10^14 gacha — `long`.","Heap'dagi eskirgan yozuvlarni olinganda tashlab yuboring."],"idea":"Dijkstra, lazy deletion, qo'shnilik ro'yxati massivlarda (tezlik uchun).","proof":"Heap'dan olingan eng kichik masofali yakunlanmagan tugunga boshqa yo'l bilan kamroqqa borib bo'lmaydi: har qanday boshqa yo'l avval masofasi kamida shuncha bo'lgan yakunlanmagan tugundan o'tadi, qirralar esa manfiy emas.","java":"import java.util.*;\nimport java.io.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n    static StringTokenizer st;\n\n    static String next() throws IOException {\n        while (st == null || !st.hasMoreTokens()) {\n            String line = br.readLine();\n            if (line == null) return null;\n            st = new StringTokenizer(line);\n        }\n        return st.nextToken();\n    }\n\n    static int ni() throws IOException { return Integer.parseInt(next()); }\n    static long nl() throws IOException { return Long.parseLong(next()); }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        int n = ni(), m = ni();\n        int[] head = new int[n], nxt = new int[m], to = new int[m];\n        long[] w = new long[m];\n        Arrays.fill(head, -1);\n        for (int i = 0; i < m; i++) {\n            int a = ni() - 1;\n            to[i] = ni() - 1;\n            w[i] = nl();\n            nxt[i] = head[a];\n            head[a] = i;\n        }\n        long[] dist = new long[n];\n        Arrays.fill(dist, Long.MAX_VALUE);\n        dist[0] = 0;\n        PriorityQueue<long[]> pq = new PriorityQueue<>((x, y) -> Long.compare(x[0], y[0]));\n        pq.add(new long[]{0, 0});\n        while (!pq.isEmpty()) {\n            long[] cur = pq.poll();\n            int v = (int) cur[1];\n            if (cur[0] > dist[v]) continue;\n            for (int e = head[v]; e != -1; e = nxt[e]) {\n                long nd = cur[0] + w[e];\n                if (nd < dist[to[e]]) {\n                    dist[to[e]] = nd;\n                    pq.add(new long[]{nd, to[e]});\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        StringBuilder out = new StringBuilder();\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) out.append(dist[i]).append(i + 1 < n ? ' ' : '\\n');\n        System.out.print(out);\n    }\n}","complexity":"Vaqt O((n + m) log m), xotira O(n + m)."},{"id":"p25","lesson":"l13","title":"Missing Coin Sum","diff":"O'rta","ref":"CSES 2183","tags":["invariant","saralash"],"check":"exact","statement":"n ta tanga, qiymatlari `x[i]`. Ularning qism-to'plami yig'indisi sifatida hosil qilib **bo'lmaydigan** eng kichik musbat son?","io":"n (1 ≤ n ≤ 2·10^5), keyin `x` (1 ≤ x ≤ 10^9). Javob.","examples":[{"input":"5\n2 9 1 2 7","output":"6"}],"hints":["Saralang. Dastlabki tangalar bilan qaysi sonlar hosil bo'ladi?","Agar `[1, S]` ning hammasi hosil bo'lsa va keyingi tanga `c ≤ S + 1`, nima bo'ladi?","`c > S + 1` bo'lsa — javob topildi."],"idea":"`reach` — hozirgacha hosil bo'ladigan oraliq oxiri. `x ≤ reach + 1` bo'lsa `reach += x`, aks holda to'xtaymiz. Javob `reach + 1`.","proof":"Invariant: birinchi i tanga bilan `[1, reach]` dagi har son hosil bo'ladi va `reach + 1` hosil bo'lmaydi. `c ≤ reach + 1` bo'lsa `[c, reach + c]` ham qamraladi va oraliqlar ulanadi. `c > reach + 1` bo'lsa, `reach + 1` ni hosil qilish uchun undan kichik tangalar yetmaydi, katta tangalar esa ortiqcha.","java":"import java.util.*;\nimport java.io.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n    static StringTokenizer st;\n\n    static String next() throws IOException {\n        while (st == null || !st.hasMoreTokens()) {\n            String line = br.readLine();\n            if (line == null) return null;\n            st = new StringTokenizer(line);\n        }\n        return st.nextToken();\n    }\n\n    static int ni() throws IOException { return Integer.parseInt(next()); }\n    static long nl() throws IOException { return Long.parseLong(next()); }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        int n = ni();\n        long[] c = new long[n];\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) c[i] = nl();\n        Arrays.sort(c);\n        long reach = 0;\n        for (long x : c) {\n            if (x > reach + 1) break;\n            reach += x;\n        }\n        System.out.println(reach + 1);\n    }\n}","complexity":"Vaqt O(n log n), xotira O(n)."},{"id":"p26","lesson":"l13","title":"Towers","diff":"O'rta","ref":"CSES 1073","tags":["multiset","patience sorting"],"check":"exact","statement":"n ta kub ketma-ket keladi, o'lchamlari `k[i]`. Har kubni tepasidagi kub **o'zidan katta** bo'lgan minoraga qo'yish yoki yangi minora boshlash mumkin. Kublar tartibi o'zgarmaydi. Minimal minoralar soni?","io":"n (1 ≤ n ≤ 2·10^5), keyin `k` (1 ≤ k ≤ 10^9). Javob.","examples":[{"input":"5\n3 8 2 1 5","output":"2"}],"hints":["Kubni qaysi minoraga qo'yish eng xavfsiz?","Katta tepalar keyingi katta kublar uchun kerak bo'ladi.","Tepasi kubdan qat'iy katta bo'lgan eng kichik tepa — `higherKey`."],"idea":"Minora tepalari multiset'da. Kub `x`: `higherKey(x)` bor bo'lsa o'sha tepani `x` ga almashtiramiz, aks holda yangi tepa `x`.","proof":"Exchange: kubni kattaroq tepaga qo'ygan yechimda ikki minoraning qolgan qismini almashtirish mumkin — tepalar to'plami \"nuqtama-nuqta\" kichikroq bo'lib qoladi, bu keyingi har kub uchun kamida shuncha imkoniyat qoldiradi. Minoralar soni — eng uzun kamaymaydigan subsequence (Dilworth).","java":"import java.util.*;\nimport java.io.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n    static StringTokenizer st;\n\n    static String next() throws IOException {\n        while (st == null || !st.hasMoreTokens()) {\n            String line = br.readLine();\n            if (line == null) return null;\n            st = new StringTokenizer(line);\n        }\n        return st.nextToken();\n    }\n\n    static int ni() throws IOException { return Integer.parseInt(next()); }\n    static long nl() throws IOException { return Long.parseLong(next()); }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        int n = ni();\n        TreeMap<Integer, Integer> tops = new TreeMap<>();\n        int towers = 0;\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n            int x = ni();\n            Integer t = tops.higherKey(x);\n            if (t != null) {\n                if (tops.merge(t, -1, Integer::sum) == 0) tops.remove(t);\n            } else towers++;\n            tops.merge(x, 1, Integer::sum);\n        }\n        System.out.println(towers);\n    }\n}","complexity":"Vaqt O(n log n), xotira O(n)."},{"id":"p27","lesson":"l14","title":"Factory Machines","diff":"O'rta","ref":"CSES 1620","tags":["binary search","greedy check"],"check":"exact","statement":"n ta mashina, i-si bitta mahsulotni `k[i]` sekundda yasaydi. Mashinalar parallel ishlaydi. t ta mahsulot yasash uchun minimal vaqt?","io":"n t (1 ≤ n ≤ 2·10^5, 1 ≤ t ≤ 10^9), keyin `k` (1 ≤ k ≤ 10^9). Minimal vaqt.","examples":[{"input":"3 7\n3 2 5","output":"8"}],"hints":["T vaqtda nechta mahsulot yasaladi?","Agar T vaqt yetsa, T+1 ham yetadimi?","Yig'indi `long`dan chiqmasligi uchun t ga yetishi bilan to'xtating."],"idea":"Javob bo'yicha binary search, `check(T) = Σ T / k[i] ≥ t`. Yuqori chegara `min(k) · t`.","proof":"`check` monoton: T oshsa har mashina yasaydigan son kamaymaydi. Har mashinaning T davomida to'xtovsiz ishlashi — T vaqtdagi maksimal ishlab chiqarish (greedy check).","java":"import java.util.*;\nimport java.io.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n    static StringTokenizer st;\n\n    static String next() throws IOException {\n        while (st == null || !st.hasMoreTokens()) {\n            String line = br.readLine();\n            if (line == null) return null;\n            st = new StringTokenizer(line);\n        }\n        return st.nextToken();\n    }\n\n    static int ni() throws IOException { return Integer.parseInt(next()); }\n    static long nl() throws IOException { return Long.parseLong(next()); }\n\n    static int[] k;\n    static long t;\n\n    static boolean check(long T) {\n        long made = 0;\n        for (int x : k) {\n            made += T / x;\n            if (made >= t) return true;\n        }\n        return false;\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        int n = ni();\n        t = nl();\n        k = new int[n];\n        long mn = Long.MAX_VALUE;\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) { k[i] = ni(); mn = Math.min(mn, k[i]); }\n        long lo = 1, hi = mn * t;\n        while (lo < hi) {\n            long mid = lo + (hi - lo) / 2;\n            if (check(mid)) hi = mid;\n            else lo = mid + 1;\n        }\n        System.out.println(lo);\n    }\n}","complexity":"Vaqt O(n log(min(k) · t)), xotira O(n)."},{"id":"p28","lesson":"l14","title":"Array Division","diff":"O'rta","ref":"CSES 1085","tags":["binary search","greedy check"],"check":"exact","statement":"n ta musbat sondan iborat massivni k ta bo'sh bo'lmagan ketma-ket bo'lakka bo'ling. Bo'laklar yig'indilarining maksimumi minimal bo'lsin. Shu minimumni toping.","io":"n k (1 ≤ k ≤ n ≤ 2·10^5), keyin massiv (1 ≤ x ≤ 10^9). Javob.","examples":[{"input":"5 3\n2 4 7 3 5","output":"8"}],"hints":["\"Maksimumni minimallashtiring\" — binary search belgisi.","S berilgan bo'lsa, har bo'lak ≤ S bo'lishi uchun minimal nechta bo'lak kerak?","Bo'lakni imkon qadar uzun qiling. k dan kam bo'lak chiqsa ham bo'ladi — ularni bo'lib yuborish mumkin."],"idea":"`check(S)`: chapdan yurib, sig'maguncha qo'shamiz; bo'laklar soni `≤ k` mi. Pastki chegara — maksimal element, yuqori — umumiy yig'indi.","proof":"Bo'lakni imkon qadar uzaytirish hech qachon bo'laklar sonini oshirmaydi (\"greedy stays ahead\": greedy'ning j-bo'lagi har qanday to'g'ri bo'lishning j-bo'lagidan oldin tugamaydi). `check` S bo'yicha monoton.","java":"import java.util.*;\nimport java.io.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n    static StringTokenizer st;\n\n    static String next() throws IOException {\n        while (st == null || !st.hasMoreTokens()) {\n            String line = br.readLine();\n            if (line == null) return null;\n            st = new StringTokenizer(line);\n        }\n        return st.nextToken();\n    }\n\n    static int ni() throws IOException { return Integer.parseInt(next()); }\n    static long nl() throws IOException { return Long.parseLong(next()); }\n\n    static long[] a;\n    static int k;\n\n    static boolean check(long S) {\n        int parts = 1;\n        long cur = 0;\n        for (long x : a) {\n            if (x > S) return false;\n            if (cur + x > S) { parts++; cur = 0; }\n            cur += x;\n        }\n        return parts <= k;\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        int n = ni();\n        k = ni();\n        a = new long[n];\n        long lo = 0, hi = 0;\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) { a[i] = nl(); lo = Math.max(lo, a[i]); hi += a[i]; }\n        while (lo < hi) {\n            long mid = lo + (hi - lo) / 2;\n            if (check(mid)) hi = mid;\n            else lo = mid + 1;\n        }\n        System.out.println(lo);\n    }\n}","complexity":"Vaqt O(n log Σ), xotira O(n)."}],"cheats":"## Fast I/O (CP shabloni)\n\n```java\nimport java.util.*;\nimport java.io.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n    static StringTokenizer st;\n\n    static String next() throws IOException {\n        while (st == null || !st.hasMoreTokens()) st = new StringTokenizer(br.readLine());\n        return st.nextToken();\n    }\n\n    static int ni() throws IOException { return Integer.parseInt(next()); }\n    static long nl() throws IOException { return Long.parseLong(next()); }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        int n = ni();\n        StringBuilder out = new StringBuilder();\n        out.append(n).append('\\n');\n        System.out.print(out);\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Xavfsiz saralash\n\n```java\nstatic void shuffleSort(int[] a) {\n    Random r = new Random();\n    for (int i = a.length - 1; i > 0; i--) {\n        int j = r.nextInt(i + 1);\n        int t = a[i]; a[i] = a[j]; a[j] = t;\n    }\n    Arrays.sort(a);\n}\n```\n\nCodeforces'da `Arrays.sort(int[])` ni O(n²) ga tushiradigan hack testlar bor. Aralashtirish yoki `long[]`/`Integer[]`ni `ArrayList` orqali saralash bu xavfni yo'qotadi.\n\n## Comparator'lar\n\n```java\nArrays.sort(a, (x, y) -> Integer.compare(x[1], y[1]));\nArrays.sort(a, (x, y) -> x[1] != y[1] ? Integer.compare(x[1], y[1]) : Integer.compare(y[0], x[0]));\nArrays.sort(a, Comparator.comparingLong((long[] x) -> x[0]).thenComparingLong(x -> x[1]));\nArrays.sort(s, (x, y) -> (y + x).compareTo(x + y));\nArrays.sort(it, (x, y) -> Long.compare(y[1] * x[0], x[1] * y[0]));\n```\n\nOxirgisi — `v/w` nisbati bo'yicha kamayish tartibi, kasrsiz.\n\n## Activity selection\n\n```java\nArrays.sort(a, (x, y) -> Integer.compare(x[1], y[1]));\nint cnt = 0;\nlong last = Long.MIN_VALUE;\nfor (int[] it : a) if (it[0] >= last) { cnt++; last = it[1]; }\n```\n\n## Sweep line\n\n```java\nlong[] ev = new long[2 * n];\nfor (int i = 0; i < n; i++) { ev[2 * i] = s[i] * 2L + 1; ev[2 * i + 1] = e[i] * 2L; }\nArrays.sort(ev);\nint cur = 0, best = 0;\nfor (long x : ev) { cur += (x & 1) == 1 ? 1 : -1; best = Math.max(best, cur); }\n```\n\n## PriorityQueue\n\n```java\nPriorityQueue<Integer> minH = new PriorityQueue<>();\nPriorityQueue<Integer> maxH = new PriorityQueue<>(Collections.reverseOrder());\nPriorityQueue<long[]> pq = new PriorityQueue<>((x, y) -> Long.compare(x[0], y[0]));\nPriorityQueue<Long> packed = new PriorityQueue<>();\npacked.add(value << 20 | index);\nlong top = packed.poll();\nint idx = (int) (top & ((1 << 20) - 1));\nlong val = top >> 20;\n```\n\n## Multiset (TreeMap)\n\n```java\nTreeMap<Integer, Integer> ms = new TreeMap<>();\nms.merge(x, 1, Integer::sum);\nif (ms.merge(x, -1, Integer::sum) == 0) ms.remove(x);\nInteger le = ms.floorKey(x);\nInteger gt = ms.higherKey(x);\n```\n\n## DSU\n\n```java\nstatic int[] par, sz;\n\nstatic int find(int x) {\n    while (par[x] != x) { par[x] = par[par[x]]; x = par[x]; }\n    return x;\n}\n\nstatic boolean union(int a, int b) {\n    a = find(a); b = find(b);\n    if (a == b) return false;\n    if (sz[a] < sz[b]) { int t = a; a = b; b = t; }\n    par[b] = a;\n    sz[a] += sz[b];\n    return true;\n}\n```\n\n## Dijkstra\n\n```java\nlong[] dist = new long[n];\nArrays.fill(dist, Long.MAX_VALUE);\ndist[s] = 0;\nPriorityQueue<long[]> pq = new PriorityQueue<>((x, y) -> Long.compare(x[0], y[0]));\npq.add(new long[]{0, s});\nwhile (!pq.isEmpty()) {\n    long[] cur = pq.poll();\n    int v = (int) cur[1];\n    if (cur[0] > dist[v]) continue;\n    for (int e = head[v]; e != -1; e = nxt[e]) {\n        long nd = cur[0] + w[e];\n        if (nd < dist[to[e]]) { dist[to[e]] = nd; pq.add(new long[]{nd, to[e]}); }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Monoton stek (satr)\n\n```java\nStringBuilder st = new StringBuilder();\nfor (char c : s.toCharArray()) {\n    while (st.length() > 0 && st.charAt(st.length() - 1) > c && canRemove()) st.deleteCharAt(st.length() - 1);\n    st.append(c);\n}\n```\n\n## Javob bo'yicha binary search\n\n```java\nlong lo = minPossible, hi = maxPossible;\nwhile (lo < hi) {\n    long mid = lo + (hi - lo) / 2;\n    if (check(mid)) hi = mid;\n    else lo = mid + 1;\n}\n\nlong lo2 = minPossible, hi2 = maxPossible;\nwhile (lo2 < hi2) {\n    long mid = lo2 + (hi2 - lo2 + 1) / 2;\n    if (check(mid)) lo2 = mid;\n    else hi2 = mid - 1;\n}\n```\n\nBirinchisi — `check` true bo'lgan **eng kichik** qiymat, ikkinchisi — **eng katta**.\n\n## Qaysi saralash kaliti?\n\n| Masala | Kalit |\n|---|---|\n| Kesishmaydigan intervallar max | tugash ↑ |\n| Minimal xonalar / qamrov | boshlanish ↑ |\n| Σ tugash vaqti min | davomiylik ↑ |\n| Σ og'irlikli tugash min | `t / w` ↑ |\n| Maksimal kechikish min | deadline ↑ |\n| Fractional knapsack | `v / w` ↓ |\n| Eng katta birlashma | `a + b` vs `b + a` |\n| Juftlash (Ferris Wheel) | ↑, ikki uchdan |\n"};
